/02/opinion/a-smarterplan-to-make-retirement-savings-last.html', 'snippet': 'The current system is leaving millions of Americans in poverty or near-poverty. Here’s a proposal to save future generations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAST month, President Obama inaugurated yet another way to encourage Americans to save for retirement. In the new myRA accounts, workers can save up to $15,000 in a low-fee investment plan that, like a government savings bond, guarantees the principal. The accounts are a small step toward helping households save, but they are not an effective solution to the coming retirement crisis.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/01/opinion/01ghilarducciWeb/01ghilarducciWeb-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/01/opinion/01ghilarducciWeb/01ghilarducciWeb-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/01/opinion/01ghilarducciWeb/01ghilarducciWeb-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/01/opinion/01ghilarducciWeb/01ghilarducciWeb-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/01/opinion/01ghilarducciWeb/01ghilarducciWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/01/opinion/01ghilarducciWeb/01ghilarducciWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth