-2427-5d00-b8f8-29080231d9fb'}, {'abstract': 'New research finds that off-site work can disrupt teamwork, alienate people who remain in the office and perpetuate increased telecommuting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/03/business/telecommuting-can-make-the-office-a-lonely-place-a-study-says.html', 'snippet': 'New research finds that off-site work can disrupt teamwork, alienate people who remain in the office and perpetuate increased telecommuting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ever since telecommuting became a viable option for a broad spectrum of workers, some companies have offered it as a tempting perk. Why not make workers happier by allowing them to spend more time with their families, avoid long commutes and exert more control over their schedules? Plus, off-site work enables businesses to save money on real estate and hire talented people who live in far-flung locations.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/03/business/03APPLIED/03APPLIED-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 979, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/03/business/03APPLIED/03APPLIED-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 979}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/03/business/03APPLIED/03APPLIED-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 628, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/03/business/03APPLIED/03APPLIED-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1255, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/03/business/03APPLIED/03APPLIED