eers and Professions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-02T17:52:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By Leigh Ann Henion', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leigh', 'middlename': 'Ann', 'lastname': 'Henion', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/459be45b-e50b-57cb-a373-6d0d843ca61f', 'word_count': 1289, 'uri': 'nyt://article/459be45b-e50b-57cb-a373-6d0d843ca61f'}, {'abstract': 'This restaurant in Peekskill puts a primacy on its tequila-rich drinks menu. But the full-service restaurant is hardly a dive, and much more than a bar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/03/nyregion/mexican-restaurant-in-downtown-peekskill-taco-dive-bar.html', 'snippet': 'This restaurant in Peekskill puts a primacy on its tequila-rich drinks menu. But the full-service restaurant is hardly a dive, and much more than a bar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The name of Taco Dive Bar, a Peekskill newcomer, suggests an emphasis on drinks, and they are good. The house margaritas are strong and tasty, made with 100 percent agave tequila, a touch of agave syrup and fresh lime, and the tequila-rich bar offers a full menu of reposados and añejos, both varieties of aged tequila, as well as the usual fare.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/03/nyregion/03DINEWE1sub/03DINEWE1sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/03/nyregion/03DINEWE1sub/03DINEWE1sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'cred