chinese-restaurants-in-long-island-beijing-house.html', 'snippet': 'Beijing House in Syosset, N.Y., a popular newcomer, is part of a resurgence of exclusively Chinese, non-fusion restaurants on Long Island.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Beijing House in Syosset is the latest example of the resurgence of Chinese restaurants on Long Island. Just a few years ago, nearly every Asian newcomer seemed to be fusion or Japanese. Diners who wanted strictly Chinese fare had to settle on the few, older and more traditional restaurants that had survived all the trends.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/03/nyregion/03DINELI1/03DINELI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 435, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/03/nyregion/03DINELI1/03DINELI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 435}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/03/nyregion/03DINELI1/03DINELI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 743, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/03/nyregion/03DINELI1/03DINELI1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1485, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/03/nyregion/03DINELI1/03DINELI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/03/nyregion/03DINELI1/03DINELI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/03/n