ed more than $300 million in the 2012 presidential race, and some experts believe that the levels may be far higher this time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/04/us/politics/dark-funds-may-bode-ill-in-2016-election.html', 'snippet': 'Contributions to entities that are not required to disclose their donors topped more than $300 million in the 2012 presidential race, and some experts believe that the levels may be far higher this time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 2016 presidential campaign seems certain to feature not only more money than any since Watergate but also more money from undisclosed donors since the days when black satchels of illicit cash were passed around.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Dark’ Funds May Bode Ill in 2016 Election', 'kicker': 'Letter from Washington', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubio, Marco', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Chamber of Commerce', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Crossroads', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-03T20:17:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Albert R. Hunt | Bloomberg View', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Albert', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Hunt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c5f88e8-f3ff-5042-bdb3-cd557436d