erson': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/22f3a046-1e63-5bee-a949-6fdd9f5fb789', 'word_count': 734, 'uri': 'nyt://article/22f3a046-1e63-5bee-a949-6fdd9f5fb789'}, {'abstract': 'Glenn Martens, the 32-year-old creative director of the French brand Y/Project, says he’s always “staring at people” to find ideas.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/04/t-magazine/fashion/glenn-martens-yproject-french-fashion-designer.html', 'snippet': 'Glenn Martens, the 32-year-old creative director of the French brand Y/Project, says he’s always “staring at people” to find ideas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Six floors above Gibus, the famed Paris punk venue where Iggy Pop and the Clash once performed, is the atelier of the new French label Y/Project. The design studio takes up the smaller of two rooms: There’s just enough space for the requisite workbenches, a couple of sewing machines and a single clothing rack, crammed with samples and vintage pieces.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Designer Who’s Inspired by People on the Subway', 'kicker': 'On the Verge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Y/Project (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martens, Glenn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-04T14:00:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alice Cavanagh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alice', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cavanagh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_i