ot to hand. There is a rumor that General Miles was killed in the battle, but this is not credited at army headquarters. According to a telegram received late to-day at Chicago, a battle between the troops and the Indians was fought to-day near the Pine Ridge Agency. Hundreds of Indians were killed, and the troops also suffered heavily.\xa0— The New York Herald, European Edition, Jan. 6, 1891', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1891: Battles With Indians', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oglala Sioux Indians', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Army', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-05T12:58:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/500e0366-5089-5c85-bc03-6d1605455e65', 'word_count': 117, 'uri': 'nyt://article/500e0366-5089-5c85-bc03-6d1605455e65'}, {'abstract': 'Two festivals, American Realness and Coil, open downtown; Big Dance offers short pieces; and the Royal Ballet exports a quadruple bill.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/05/arts/dance/dance-this-week-realness-starts-on-the-lower-east-side.html', 'snippet': 'Two festivals, American Realness and Coil, open downtown; Big Dance offers short pieces; and the Royal Ballet exports a quadruple bill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'American Realness 2016', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '