e window.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/06/us/06sanbernardino-web/06sanbernardino-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/06/us/06sanbernardino-web/06sanbernardino-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/06/us/06sanbernardino-web/06sanbernardino-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/06/us/06sanbernardino-web/06sanbernardino-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/06/us/06sanbernardino-web/06sanbernardino-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/06/us/06sanbernardino-web/06sanbernardino-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/06/us/06sanbernardino-web/06sanbernardino-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Help Sought to Close 18-Minute Gap in San Bernardino Inquiry', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Help Sought on 18-Minute Gap in California Killers’ Timeline', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'San Bernardino, Calif, Shooting (2015)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Farook, Syed Rizwan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Malik, Tashfeen', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Bernardino (Calif)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-05T22:29:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Nagourney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nagourney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c043999-f6bc-5d3e-926d-8fd872c40651', 'word_count': 557, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c043999-f6bc-5d3e-926d-8fd872c40651'}, {'abstract': 'This recipe for a Kombucha-based elixir, from the new Naturopathica Chelsea outpost, includes ginger, lemongrass — and horseradish and cayenne.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/05/t-magazine/fashion/naturopathica-chelsea-cold-care-recipe.html', 'snippet': 'This recipe for a Kombucha-based elixir, from the new Naturopathica Chelsea outpost, includes ginger, lemongrass — and horseradish and cayenne.', 'lead_paragraph': '“In retrospect, I think I was a little ahead of my time,” says Barbara Close, the founder and CEO of the healing-arts brand Naturopathica. When she opened her East Hampton store in 1995, people would stop in and “take these herbal tinctures and say, ‘Ooh, these taste bitter’ — they didn’t really understand how to use them,” she recalls. Back then, she says, the path to health was: “You get sick, you hope to get an appointment with your doctor, you get a prescription and it treats your symptoms. Now, wellness has become mainstream.” And the biggest change, according to Close, may be how we approach it: “It’s the periods in between doctor appointments that are important. What are the rituals of self-care that you can do preventatively to keep your health and vitality at its best?” She offers answers aplenty at Naturopathica Chelsea, her second brick-and-mortar location.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/05/t-magazine/05tmag-naturopathica/05tmag-naturopathica-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/05/t-magazine/05tmag-naturopathica/05tmag-naturopathica-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/05/t-magazine/05tmag-naturopathica/05tmag-naturopathica-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/05/t-magazine/05tmag-naturopathica/05tmag-naturopathica-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/05/t-magazine/05tmag-naturopathica/05tmag-naturopathica-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/05/t-magazine/05tmag-naturopathica/05tmag-naturopathica-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/05/t-magazine/05tmag-naturopathica/05tmag-naturopathica-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLar