ate/commercial/a-conversation-with-thomas-j-derosa.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. DeRosa, 58, is chief executive of Welltower, a real estate investment trust based in Toledo, Ohio, that specializes in the health care sector.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mr. DeRosa, 58, is chief executive of Welltower, a real estate investment trust based in Toledo, Ohio, that specializes in the health care sector, which includes senior living facilities. A longtime company director, he became C.E.O. in April 2014. Previously Mr. DeRosa served as a vice chairman and chief financial officer of the Rouse Company before its merger with General Growth Properties. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/06/business/06INTERVIEW/06INTERVIEW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/06/business/06INTERVIEW/06INTERVIEW-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/06/business/06INTERVIEW/06INTERVIEW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/06/business/06INTERVIEW/06INTERVIEW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1367, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/06/business/06INTERVIEW/06INTERVIEW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/06/business/06INTERVIEW/06INTERVIEW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0