/01/06/amid-conflict-life-and-art-in-goma/', 'snippet': 'Looking for a different narrative in a conflict-torn region, Natalie Keyssar looked at the lives of young people in Goma in eastern Democratic Republic of Congo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last July, Natalie Keyssar traveled to Goma in eastern Democratic Republic of Congo set on telling a story about the region that was different from the many narratives about its refugee population or the scars from recent wars. Instead, she spent the month among the area’s youth, letting them dictate the subject matter. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amid Conflict, Life and Art in Goma', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Soldiers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Youth', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keyssar, Natalie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "International Women's Media Foundation", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Goma (Congo, Democratic Republic of)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-06T10:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Boryga', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Boryga', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a3898d66-7033-564d-b48e-b2f94da9809b', 'word_count': 507, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a3898d66-7033-564d-b48e-b2f94da9809b'}, {'abstract': 'The 17-year-old’s appearance in a new ad campaign is writing yet another chapter in gender fluidity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/07/fashion/jaden-smith-for-louis-vuitton