'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5fc08740-7185-51da-b169-f9309275980b', 'word_count': 1193, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5fc08740-7185-51da-b169-f9309275980b'}, {'abstract': 'William Caruth, 61, was arrested on Wednesday hours after the body of his 39-year-old daughter, Andrea Caruth, 39, was found in a hole beneath the basement of her home in the Bronx.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/07/nyregion/body-found-in-bronx-home-of-missing-woman.html', 'snippet': 'William Caruth, 61, was arrested on Wednesday hours after the body of his 39-year-old daughter, Andrea Caruth, 39, was found in a hole beneath the basement of her home in the Bronx.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At five months pregnant, Andrea Caruth was counting down the days until she learned the gender of her baby. She had arranged to meet her best friend for a shopping trip after a doctor’s visit on Wednesday, another step toward motherhood for a woman who had looked forward to it for years as she took care of young children at a day care center in her home in the Bronx.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/nyregion/07BODY1/07BODY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/07/nyregion/07BODY1/07BODY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/nyregion/07BODY1/07BODY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/nyregion/07BODY1/07BODY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1337, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name':