: 731, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8c6a161-586b-5bf5-ae61-50c673479e10'}, {'abstract': 'The playwright talks about her incentive for injecting a cathartic surprise into the play, which centers on two teenagers bonding over poetry homework.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/10/theater/lauren-gunderson-on-i-and-you-a-play-with-an-explosive-twist.html', 'snippet': 'The playwright talks about her incentive for injecting a cathartic surprise into the play, which centers on two teenagers bonding over poetry homework.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A playwright who makes a living writing plays is an anomaly in any city, but it’s especially rare to build a viable career almost entirely outside New York. It has worked for Lauren Gunderson, whose plays have been steadily produced by theaters around the country, including in her current home base, San Francisco, since she received a masters in dramatic writing from New York University in 2009.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 889, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 889}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 692, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1383, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/10/a