-fcac-5553-853d-09a1144d7bd3', 'word_count': 119, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d40d9108-fcac-5553-853d-09a1144d7bd3'}, {'abstract': 'As they moved to raise interest rates in December, some Federal Reserve officials were cautious in their assumptions about the months ahead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/07/business/economy/fed-minutes-december-rate-increase.html', 'snippet': 'As they moved to raise interest rates in December, some Federal Reserve officials were cautious in their assumptions about the months ahead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Janet L. Yellen, the Federal Reserve chairwoman, marshaled a strong consensus among Fed officials for the momentous decision to raise the central bank’s benchmark interest rate last month, but concerns among policy makers about the strength of economic growth could slow the march toward higher rates.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/business/07fed-web/07fed-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/07/business/07fed-web/07fed-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/business/07fed-web/07fed-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/business/07fed-web/07fed-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1397, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/business/07fed-web/07fed-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75