e sings primarily in Mandarin, and — as her 2.5 million followers on the Chinese microblogging site Weibo suggest — a majority of her fans are from mainland China.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Cultural Revolution in Malaysia', 'kicker': 'Contributing Op-Ed Writer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Cultural Revolution in Malaysia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Malaysia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-07T13:16:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tash Aw', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tash', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Aw', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/1b85d56a-4c49-500b-b845-c2b0e0cd18a6', 'word_count': 902, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b85d56a-4c49-500b-b845-c2b0e0cd18a6'}, {'abstract': 'A returnee to New York City after 30 years in Europe was amazed at how many things one can get delivered to one’s doorstep.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/07/nyregion/metropolitan-diary-absolutely-final-delivery.html', 'snippet': 'A returnee to New York City after 30 years in Europe was amazed at how many things one can get delivered to one’s doorstep.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dear Diary:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Absolutely Final Delivery', 'kicker': 'Metropolitan Diary', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-01-07T13:30:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'origin