ct': 'The legislation will allow Poland’s new conservative government to appoint and dismiss the executives in charge of public television and radio broadcasters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/08/world/europe/poland-andrzej-duda-press-freedom.html', 'snippet': 'The legislation will allow Poland’s new conservative government to appoint and dismiss the executives in charge of public television and radio broadcasters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WARSAW — Poland’s president, Andrzej Duda, signed a law on Thursday that gives the government greater control over state broadcasters, despite the objections of European Union officials who fear that the measure will weaken freedom of the press.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Poland’s President Approves Controls on State Media, Alarming E.U. Leaders', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World Briefing | Europe; Poland: Media Law Stirs Concerns', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Poland', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of the Press', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duda, Andrzej (1972- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-07T17:14:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanna Berendt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berendt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b82763c-cdb4-543d-9a45-29eb94b3b2a0', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b82763c-cdb4-543d-9a45-29eb94b3b2a0'}, {'abstract': 'Parents are relying more on talk than tools to monitor teenagers online.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/07/parents-monitoring-teenagers-online-and-mostly-getting-it-right/', 'snippet': 'Parents are relying more on talk than tools to monitor teenagers online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the last few months, researchers from Pew have been looking at parents, teenagers and the Internet. They’ve looked at how teenagers live their lives online, and how they feel about that new (to adults) arena. Now, in a newly released report, the researchers are exploring what parents and teenagers say about how parents monitor teenagers online and, perhaps more interestingly, how they don’t. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/us/smartphones-motherlode/smartphones-motherlode-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/07/us/smartphones-motherlode/smartphones-motherlode-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/us/smartphones-motherlode/smartphones-motherlode-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 763, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/us/smartphones-motherlode/smartphones-motherlode-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1526, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/us/smartphones-motherlode/smartphones-motherlode-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 's