y Donald J. Trump’s planned rally on Thursday night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/01/07/an-ice-cream-mogul-and-his-fellow-burlingtonians-react-to-a-trump-rally/', 'snippet': 'In a liberal enclave fiercely loyal to Bernie Sanders, Burlington’s former mayor, residents were amazed and perplexed by Donald J. Trump’s planned rally on Thursday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BURLINGTON, Vt. — As a line of hundreds snaked around the block and down the street from where Donald J. Trump was set to hold a rally on Thursday night, more than 100 protesters gathered across the street, hoisting signs reading “Bern, Trump, Bern” and chanting that Mr. Trump should stay away. More demonstrators clustered nearly, holding candles in silent vigil.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/us/07firstdraft-dumptrump/07firstdraft-dumptrump-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 333, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/07/us/07firstdraft-dumptrump/07firstdraft-dumptrump-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 333}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/us/07firstdraft-dumptrump/07firstdraft-dumptrump-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 569, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/us/07firstdraft-dumptrump/07firstdraft-dumptrump-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1138, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/07/us/07firstdraft-dumptrump/07firstdraft-dumptrump-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name