ected to the Hall of Fame this week but never did play in the World Series. Mike Piazza, who will share the stage in Cooperstown this summer, made it there once and lost.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/08/sports/08KEPNER/08KEPNER-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/08/sports/08KEPNER/08KEPNER-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/08/sports/08KEPNER/08KEPNER-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 820, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/08/sports/08KEPNER/08KEPNER-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1167, 'width': 1458, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/08/sports/08KEPNER/08KEPNER-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/08/sports/08KEPNER/08KEPNER-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/08/sports/08KEPNER/08KEPNER-thumbLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Two Homers, Emotions Go Deep for Ken Griffey Jr. and Mike Piazza', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Two Homers, the Emotions Go Deep', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'