ted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/be917ae2-2226-54a4-b539-cc6de3f13f10', 'word_count': 847, 'uri': 'nyt://article/be917ae2-2226-54a4-b539-cc6de3f13f10'}, {'abstract': 'I’ll miss the House of Representatives, but I won’t miss begging for money.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/09/opinion/steve-israel-confessions-of-a-congressman.html', 'snippet': 'I’ll miss the House of Representatives, but I won’t miss begging for money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Washington — IT’S now safe to pick up your phones and read your emails. That’s right, I won’t be calling to ask you to donate to my congressional campaign. As I announced on Tuesday, I’ll be leaving Congress at the end of this term — sentimental about many things, but liberated from a fund-raising regime that’s never been more dangerous to our democracy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/opinion/09israelWeb/09israelWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/09/opinion/09israelWeb/09israelWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/opinion/09israelWeb/09israelWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/opinion/09israelWeb/09israelWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1343, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/opinion/09israelWeb/09israelWeb