nd Kristen Wiig make the W Magazine soiree, but it’s “Mr. Robot’s” Rami Malek who’s most sought after.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — It’s been rainy and cold here, with nighttime temperatures in the 40s, and the Beverly Hilton, where the Golden Globes will be held on Sunday, isn’t looking glamorous at all, thanks to a new 12-story hotel going up in front of it. (It’s to be a Waldorf Astoria.) Things feel topsy-turvy, but, then again, it’s been a topsy-turvy awards season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08BLANCHETT-WEB/08BLANCHETT-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 843, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08BLANCHETT-WEB/08BLANCHETT-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 843}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08BLANCHETT-WEB/08BLANCHETT-WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 729, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08BLANCHETT-WEB/08BLANCHETT-WEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1464, 'width': 1042, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08BLANCHETT-WEB/08BLANCHETT-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08BLANCHETT-WEB/08BLANCHETT-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08BLANCHETT-WEB/08BLANCHETT-WEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150