ck, Robyn, Haim and M83 are also on the lineup for the festival, scheduled for June 3-5 on Randalls Island.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/08/governors-ball-kanye-west-strokes-killers/', 'snippet': 'Beck, Robyn, Haim and M83 are also on the lineup for the festival, scheduled for June 3-5 on Randalls Island.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In its quest to compete with Coachella, Bonnaroo and Lollapalooza, New York’s own big summer festival, Governors Ball, is going with Kanye West. The rapper has received top billing for the 2016 event along with the Strokes and the Killers. Beck, Robyn, Haim and M83 are also on the lineup for the festival, scheduled for June 3-5 on Randalls Island.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08KANYE-WEST-WEB/08KANYE-WEST-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08KANYE-WEST-WEB/08KANYE-WEST-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08KANYE-WEST-WEB/08KANYE-WEST-WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08KANYE-WEST-WEB/08KANYE-WEST-WEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08KANYE-WEST-WEB/08KANYE-WEST-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/09/arts/08KA