he lead role in parenting, and supporting a spouse’s career, isn’t necessarily a compromise.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/10/a-less-prominent-career-a-more-primary-parent-and-satisfied/', 'snippet': 'Taking the lead role in parenting, and supporting a spouse’s career, isn’t necessarily a compromise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'These days, when she judges the moment right, my wife has taken to praising me as “a great dad” in the mixed company of family and friends. I’ve practiced an aw-shucks shrug for the occasion. I suspect many modern dads are paid similar compliments for doing things moms have done for eons. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/08/us/playground-dad-motherlode/playground-dad-motherlode-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/08/us/playground-dad-motherlode/playground-dad-motherlode-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/08/us/playground-dad-motherlode/playground-dad-motherlode-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 633, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/08/us/playground-dad-motherlode/playground-dad-motherlode-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1266, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/08/us/playground-dad-motherlode/playground-dad-motherlode-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/08/us/playground-dad-moth