aves, but for a number of different reasons.', 'lead_paragraph': '“People come in saying, ‘How sad! They got him!,’” said Gloria Calixto on Sunday, from behind the counter of Guadalupita II, a corner store in Sunset Park, Brooklyn, that was bursting with piñatas and sugar-dusted pastries, chilies and Virgin Mary figurines.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/11/nyregion/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/11/nyregion/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/11/nyregion/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/11/nyregion/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/11/nyregion/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/11/nyregion/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/11/nyregion/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2/11ELCHAPOREACTweb2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'he