British warships, the communiqué said, was made at about noon yesterday by torpedo and dive-bombing planes.  — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Jan. 12, 1941', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/blogs/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 787, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/12/blogs/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 787}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/blogs/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 610, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/blogs/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 610, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/blogs/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/12/blogs/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/blogs/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1/12iht-retrospective-Mediterranean1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cr