_works', 'value': 'Gin: The Manual (Book)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-11T19:08:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd08381a-f63a-567a-898b-f4c5fd38909b', 'word_count': 599, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd08381a-f63a-567a-898b-f4c5fd38909b'}, {'abstract': 'A gun battle raged for nearly two hours in the Iraqi capital, but most of the casualties were caused by a car bomb and two suicide bombers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/12/world/middleeast/isis-attack-on-baghdad-mall-kills-17.html', 'snippet': 'A gun battle raged for nearly two hours in the Iraqi capital, but most of the casualties were caused by a car bomb and two suicide bombers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD — Islamic State militants attacked a shopping mall in eastern Baghdad on Monday evening, killing at least 17 people and turning the neighborhood into an urban war zone at rush hour, with helicopters hovering overhead and snipers taking positions on nearby rooftops.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'ISIS Attack on Baghdad Mall Kills 17', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Islamic State Claims Deadly Baghdad Attack ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Baghdad (Iraq)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arango, Tim', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 5,