multimedia quest to uncover details about his father’s past.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/12/theater/review-lars-jans-the-institute-of-memory-time-is-a-search-for-identity.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Jan’s play is a multimedia quest to uncover details about his father’s past.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The “searching for my father” (or, less often, “mother”) play or film is a genre at this point, but not many of the works in it are as adventurous as “The Institute of Memory (TIMe),” Lars Jan’s multimedia personal journey, part of the Under the Radar festival. Not many delve as deeply, either. Mr. Jan goes right into the brain of his father in search of a man who always seemed a cipher.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12INSTITUTE/12INSTITUTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12INSTITUTE/12INSTITUTE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12INSTITUTE/12INSTITUTE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12INSTITUTE/12INSTITUTE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12INSTITUTE/12INSTITUTE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12INSTITUTE/12INSTITUTE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth