ucky: Notice Served on Closing of Health Site', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | South', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kentucky: Notice Served on Closing of Health Site', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kentucky', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bevin, Matthew', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Health and Human Services Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burwell, Sylvia Mathews', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-12T00:51:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Abby Goodnough', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Abby', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goodnough', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/1dc4b50f-c450-5ac8-a732-aa9b826c62ad', 'word_count': 113, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1dc4b50f-c450-5ac8-a732-aa9b826c62ad'}, {'abstract': 'For Beijing Kunlun, Grindr offers a chance to expand beyond its gaming assets, as well as markets outside China.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/12/technology/grindr-sells-stake-to-chinese-company.html', 'snippet': 'For Beijing Kunlun, Grindr offers a chance to expand beyond its gaming assets, as well as markets outside China.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Grindr, the popular dating and social networking app for gay men, has found itself a match.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/business/14GRINDER/14GRINDER-articleLarge.jpg', 