in her bedroom on Saturday by her landlady and her boyfriend.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/12/world/europe/italy-american-woman-found-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Local news reports said the body of the woman, Ashley Ann Olsen, 35, was found in her bedroom on Saturday by her landlady and her boyfriend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Prosecutors in Florence are investigating the death of a young American woman who was found in her apartment in the center of the city over the weekend, the police said on Monday. Local news reports said the body of the woman, Ashley Ann Olsen, 35, was found in her bedroom on Saturday by her landlady and her boyfriend, Federico Fiorentini, a well-known local artist. There were reports that marks were found on Ms. Olsen’s neck, suggesting she may have been strangled. Pathologists were performing an autopsy on Monday to determine the time and cause of death. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Italy: American Woman Found Dead', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Europe; Italy: American Woman Found Dead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florence (Italy)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pianigiani, Gaia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olsen, Ashley Ann', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-12T03:55:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gaia Pianigiani', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gaia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pianigiani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organi