stage, screen and television, was best known for his antic turn as the deranged General Garcia in the 1979 film comedy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/12/arts/television/richard-libertini-character-actor-with-a-memorable-turn-in-the-in-laws-dies-at-82.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Libertini, a ubiquitous presence on stage, screen and television, was best known for his antic turn as the deranged General Garcia in the 1979 film comedy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Richard Libertini, a character actor best known for his antic turn as a deranged Latin American general in the 1979 film comedy “The In-Laws,” died on Thursday at his home in Venice, Calif. He was 82.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12libertini-obit-web/12libertini-obit-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 878, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12libertini-obit-web/12libertini-obit-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 878}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12libertini-obit-web/12libertini-obit-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 700, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12libertini-obit-web/12libertini-obit-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1400, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/12libertini-obit-web/12libertini-obit-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/1