 The group spent months in search of an alternative to Hillary Clinton and invested $1 million in ads to draft Elizabeth Warren.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/01/12/moveon-site-puts-its-backing-behind-bernie-sanders/', 'snippet': '“MoveOn members are feeling the Bern,” the liberal website’s political action executive director said, in endorsing Bernie Sanders. The group spent months in search of an alternative to Hillary Clinton and invested $1 million in ads to draft Eliza...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The liberal political group MoveOn.org threw its endorsement to Senator Bernie Sanders in the Democratic presidential contest, backing him after its officials spent months in search of an alternative to Hillary Clinton and invested $1 million in ads to draft Senator Elizabeth Warren for the race.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/us/12firstdraft-moveon/12firstdraft-moveon-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/12/us/12firstdraft-moveon/12firstdraft-moveon-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/us/12firstdraft-moveon/12firstdraft-moveon-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/us/12firstdraft-moveon/12firstdraft-moveon-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/us/12firstdraft-moveon/12firstdraft-moveon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75