w York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2f8e34f-7c11-56ea-838d-d867fa6677f0', 'word_count': 482, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2f8e34f-7c11-56ea-838d-d867fa6677f0'}, {'abstract': 'Jim Rutenberg, chief political correspondent for the Sunday magazine, will fill the role last held by David Carr, who died in February.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/13/business/media/new-york-times-names-new-media-columnist.html', 'snippet': 'Jim Rutenberg, chief political correspondent for the Sunday magazine, will fill the role last held by David Carr, who died in February.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York Times said on Tuesday that Jim Rutenberg, chief political correspondent for the Sunday magazine, would become its media columnist, filling a role that has been vacant since the death of David Carr about a year ago.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Times Names New Media Columnist', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Times Names Its New Media Columnist', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rutenberg, Jim', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carr, David', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-12T17:00:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e64465d-71e4-5000-9126-a7d7f5f4c2b1', 'word_count': 263, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e64465d-71e4-5000-9126-a7d7f5f4c2b1'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Barnett, who succeeds Rachel S. Moore, is a ballet aficionado with a long career in the arts, including her most recent position as managing director of Lincoln Center International.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/13/arts/dance/american-ballet-theater-names-kara-medoff-barnett-executive-director.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Barnett, who succeeds Rachel S. Moore, is a ballet aficionado with a long career in the arts, including her most recent position as managing director of Lincoln Center International.', 'lead_paragraph': 'She started ballet lessons at 3 in North Carolina, but gave up dancing for college, then Harvard Business School and a career in the arts that eventually led her to become an executive at Lincoln Center. Now Kara Medoff Barnett is returning to her first love: She will be the next executive director of American Ballet Theater, the company announced on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/13ABT/13ABT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/13ABT/13ABT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/13ABT/13ABT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/13ABT/13ABT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'ima