 the simple style in their fall/ winter 2016 collections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/12/t-magazine/fashion/mens-fashion-week-classic-white-shirts.html', 'snippet': 'Alexander McQueen, Wales Bonner and Rory Parnell-Mooney showed the simple style in their fall/ winter 2016 collections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'London is a city where, at least with respect to fashion shows, anything goes — from pants with butt cleavage to bucket headpieces. All the more reason for a classic white shirt to feel special. They’ve popped up all over the London Collections: Men fall/winter 2016 runways, in such wildly disparate shows as Wales Bonner and Rory Parnell-Mooney (where references ranged from the jazz composer Sun Ra to catholic schools, respectively). At Alexander McQueen, a simple white shirt was the perfect foil to bold prints and ornate gilets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/11/t-magazine/11tmag-whiteshirts-01/11tmag-whiteshirts-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/11/t-magazine/11tmag-whiteshirts-01/11tmag-whiteshirts-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/11/t-magazine/11tmag-whiteshirts-01/11tmag-whiteshirts-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/11/t-magazine/11tmag-whiteshirts-01/11tmag-whiteshirts-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/11/t-magazine/11t