l': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7e18551-8c60-566b-add5-9ae499e23561', 'word_count': 138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7e18551-8c60-566b-add5-9ae499e23561'}, {'abstract': 'Women made up 9 percent of the filmmakers behind the top-grossing movies in 2015, up from 7 percent the year before.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/13/movies/number-of-female-directors-of-top-films-ticks-up-study-says.html', 'snippet': 'Women made up 9 percent of the filmmakers behind the top-grossing movies in 2015, up from 7 percent the year before.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The latest study on gender equality in Hollywood found that last year, women accounted for 9 percent of the directors of the 250 top-grossing domestic films. This might not sound great, but it’s an improvement over 2014, when women made up just 7 percent of directors for those films. The 2015 result put women on par with the level achieved in 1998.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/arts/12FILMMAKERS/12FILMMAKERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 457, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/16/arts/12FILMMAKERS/12FILMMAKERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 457}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/arts/12FILMMAKERS/12FILMMAKERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 781, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/arts/12FILMMAKERS/12FILMMAKERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1561, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '