ost of his prime years before baseball’s color barrier was shattered, died on Monday night at his home in Houston. He was 96.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/sports/irvin-obit-1-web/irvin-obit-1-web-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 517, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/13/sports/irvin-obit-1-web/irvin-obit-1-web-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 517}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/sports/irvin-obit-1-web/irvin-obit-1-web-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 882, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/sports/irvin-obit-1-web/irvin-obit-1-web-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1765, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/sports/irvin-obit-1-web/irvin-obit-1-web-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/13/sports/irvin-obit-1-web/irvin-obit-1-web-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/sports/irvin-obit-1-web/irvin-obit-1-web-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Monte Irvin, Star Outfielder Who Lost His Prime to Racism, Dies at 96', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Monte Irvin, Star Outfielder