fashion critic Vanessa Friedman started working on a piece about Mr. Bowie’s legacy the morning after learning of his death.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/12/insider/bowie-again-fashion-critics-notebook.html', 'snippet': 'The fashion critic Vanessa Friedman started working on a piece about Mr. Bowie’s legacy the morning after learning of his death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Emails about how best to report on the formative relationship David Bowie had with the fashion industry started to swirl through the Style section (and between the Style and Culture sections) as soon as we heard news of Mr. Bowie’s death.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/music/20160112_BOWIE_HP-slide-8HWE/20160112_BOWIE_HP-slide-8HWE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/music/20160112_BOWIE_HP-slide-8HWE/20160112_BOWIE_HP-slide-8HWE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/music/20160112_BOWIE_HP-slide-8HWE/20160112_BOWIE_HP-slide-8HWE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/music/20160112_BOWIE_HP-slide-8HWE/20160112_BOWIE_HP-slide-8HWE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/music/20160112_BOWIE_HP-slide-8HWE/20160112_BOWIE_HP-slide-8HWE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/12/arts/music/20