 better known for their work with pop stars and other big names.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The scores from new movies are often less likely to have the kind of wider cultural impact that make the themes from “Star Wars” or “Raiders of the Lost Ark” instantly hummable. But many of the artists working in film composition today have recorded or produced hits before. For instance, Trent Reznor, who with Nine Inch Nails made multiplatinum records, gained prestige of a different kind when he and Atticus Ross won Oscars for their score for “The Social Network” in 2011.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/creed-image/creed-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/creed-image/creed-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/creed-image/creed-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/creed-image/creed-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1151, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/creed-image/creed-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/creed-image/creed-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/13/arts/creed-image/creed-image-thum