mes.com/2016/01/13/retired-art-teacher-leaves-1-7-million-to-the-detroit-institute-of-arts/', 'snippet': 'Elizabeth Verdow, who died in 2014, spent her career teaching in the Detroit public schools, and volunteered at the museum for almost two decades.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not much more than a year ago, the Detroit Institute of Arts was in an existential crisis, its world-class collection in danger of being parceled off by its beleaguered city to help pay debts in Detroit’s federal bankruptcy.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/arts/DIA/DIA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 576, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/arts/DIA/DIA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1031, 'width': 579, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/arts/DIA/DIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/14/arts/DIA/DIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/arts/DIA/DIA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Retired Art Teacher Leaves $1.7 Million to the Detroit Institute of Arts', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Detroit Institute of Arts Gets $1.7 Million From Teacher', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizatio