ision. But a lawyer for the Obama administration was adamant that the court’s decision should be based on the fundamental ground that the commonwealth is a territory of the United States without independent sovereignty.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Justices Hear Case Over Puerto Rico’s Sovereignty', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Supreme Court Hears Case That Could Clarify Whether Puerto Rico Is Sovereign', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Puerto Rico', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Double Jeopardy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Constitution (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanchez Valle, Luis M', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vazquez, Gomez', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-13T22:08:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Liptak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Liptak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8586a00-7fe8-5ef1-93d8-4d2c3ff9d5d8', 'word_count': 606, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8586a00-7fe8-5ef1-93d8-4d2c3ff9d5d8'}, {'abstract': 'The 18-year-old victim was shot in the head, and a second teenager was hospitalized after being shot in the arm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/14/nyregion/teenager-killed-in-shooting-near-brooklyn-schools.html', 'snippet': 'The 18-year-old victim was shot in the head, and a second teenager was hospitalized after being shot in the arm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An 18-year-old man was killed and a second teenager was wounded on Wednesday in a shooting on a Brooklyn street busy with students who had just been dismissed for the day from a nearby high school campus, the authorities said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/nyregion/14SHOT/14SHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/14/nyregion/14SHOT/14SHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/nyregion/14SHOT/14SHOT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/nyregion/14SHOT/14SHOT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/nyregion/14SHOT/14SHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/14/nyregion/14SHOT/14SHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/nyregion/14SHOT/14SHOT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Teenager Killed in Shooting Near Brooklyn Schools', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Teenager Is Killed in a Shooting Ne