: '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddc1ddd3-50b5-5372-b8bd-c8c45459e90c', 'word_count': 402, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddc1ddd3-50b5-5372-b8bd-c8c45459e90c'}, {'abstract': 'A manwas arrested in the death of an American woman whose body was found in her apartment in Florence last weekend.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/14/world/europe/italy-arrest-in-killing-of-american.html', 'snippet': 'A manwas arrested in the death of an American woman whose body was found in her apartment in Florence last weekend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The police in Italy have arrested a man in the death of an American woman whose body was found in her apartment in Florence last weekend, according to Italian news reports on Thursday. The man, who was not identified, was facing a charge of aggravated murder in connection with the death of the woman, Ashley Ann Olsen, 35, according to the news agency ANSA. The suspect, who was described as a 25-year-old African immigrant, was ordered detained by the prosecutor in Florence. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Italy: Arrest in Killing of American', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Europe; Italy: Arrest in Killing of American', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olsen, Ashley Ann', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florence (Italy)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-14T05:41:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Southall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Southall', 'qualif