nyt://article/a13505ad-0fb7-54a3-acdd-29532dd15ce1'}, {'abstract': 'The men were convicted of having helped a gang of four aging thieves who drilled into the side of a safe deposit building to steal a trove of gold, gems and jewelry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/15/world/europe/london-hatton-garden-burglary.html', 'snippet': 'The men were convicted of having helped a gang of four aging thieves who drilled into the side of a safe deposit building to steal a trove of gold, gems and jewelry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — It has been called the largest burglary in England’s history: four aging thieves who conspired to steal about $20 million in gold, jewelry and gems from Hatton Garden Safe Deposit Ltd. in London, aided by the book “Forensics for Dummies” and diamond-tipped power drills that could penetrate concrete.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/world/15hatton_web1/15hatton_web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/15/world/15hatton_web1/15hatton_web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/world/15hatton_web1/15hatton_web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/world/15hatton_web1/15hatton_web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/world/15hatton_web1/15hatton_web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width':