pling, Saoirse Ronan and Rooney Mara.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Upstart ingenues and heavy hitters figure equally in today’s  Oscar nominations for Best Actress and Best Supporting Actress — and in the pages of T. Read on to see what four of this year’s nominated actresses have told us about their craft.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/t-magazine/14tmag-oscarnoms/14tmag-oscarnoms-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 182, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/14/t-magazine/14tmag-oscarnoms/14tmag-oscarnoms-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 182}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/t-magazine/14tmag-oscarnoms/14tmag-oscarnoms-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 311, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/t-magazine/14tmag-oscarnoms/14tmag-oscarnoms-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/t-magazine/14tmag-oscarnoms/14tmag-oscarnoms-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/14/t-magazine/14tmag-oscarnoms/14tmag-oscarnoms-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/14/t-magazine/14tmag-oscarnoms/14tmag-oscarnoms-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Four Oscar-Nominated