. Now, the few remaining vines survive in one of the many yards in which residents enjoy the high-status hobby of grape-growing.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Santa Cruz Cabernet: Wines You Never Knew', 'kicker': 'The Pour', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The California Cabernets You Never Knew', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Asimov, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cabernet Sauvignon (Wine)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kennedy, Kathryn, Winery', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ridge Vineyards', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-14T20:10:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Asimov', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Asimov', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c96db3df-4c7c-5cc1-a8a8-af689a15e3a7', 'word_count': 1594, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c96db3df-4c7c-5cc1-a8a8-af689a15e3a7'}, {'abstract': 'Analyzing the double-cross step by step, Ms. Konnikova explains the psychology of the grifter and the mark.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/15/books/review-in-the-confidence-game-by-maria-konnikova-the-siren-call-of-the-swindler.html', 'snippet': 'Analyzing the double-cross step by step, Ms. Konnikova explains the psychology of the grifter and the mark.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Almost all of us are suckers for books about suckers. What’s not to like? They flatter our lofty conception of ourselves — no chumps are we, with our wits about us and our n