John McDaniel performed on Wednesday at Feinstein’s/54 Below.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/15/arts/music/review-barb-jungr-applies-her-emphatic-voice-to-the-beatles-music.html', 'snippet': 'This British cabaret singer and the Broadway musical director John McDaniel performed on Wednesday at Feinstein’s/54 Below.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Who among us isn’t familiar with the refrain “Ah, look at all the lonely people” from the Beatles classic “Eleanor Rigby”? To hear it performed by the great British cabaret singer Barb Jungr and the Broadway musical director John McDaniel at Feinstein’s/54 Below on Wednesday evening was to find it clarified as never before.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15JUNGR/15JUNGR-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15JUNGR/15JUNGR-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15JUNGR/15JUNGR-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15JUNGR/15JUNGR-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1279, 'width': 1892, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15JUNGR/15JUNGR-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15JUNGR/15JUNGR-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype