n Jeong, Olivia Munn and Sherri Shepherd lend a hand.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/15/movies/review-ride-along-2-reloads-twin-barrels-of-ice-cube-and-kevin-hart.html', 'snippet': 'The stars reunite as mismatched police partners, now on a Miami drug lord’s trail. Ken Jeong, Olivia Munn and Sherri Shepherd lend a hand.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Ride Along 2,” it may not surprise you to learn, is a lot like “Ride Along,” only less so. The buddy-cop action-comedy is a foolproof genre, though it’s also one that requires a fool. This franchise is lucky to have Kevin Hart in that role, and his manic comic energy is enough to make the sequel something other than a complete waste of time. But the genre is also stubbornly innovation-proof, and there’s not much new to see here.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15RIDEALONG/15RIDEALONG-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15RIDEALONG/15RIDEALONG-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15RIDEALONG/15RIDEALONG-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 645, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15RIDEALONG/15RIDEALONG-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1290, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15RIDEALONG/15RIDEALONG-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', '