“In the Shadow of Women,” Philippe Garrel’s slender new drama, invites you to take its title ironically. Manon and Pierre, the married couple at its center, are Parisian bohemians who embrace a traditional asymmetry in their roles. They work together making documentary films, but they are Pierre’s films. Manon, who earns money serving lunch in a school cafeteria, is proud to subordinate her own ambitions to her husband’s. “It’s not a sacrifice, it’s a choice,” she tells her skeptical mother.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15INSHADOW1/15INSHADOW1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 439, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15INSHADOW1/15INSHADOW1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 439}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15INSHADOW1/15INSHADOW1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 748, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15INSHADOW1/15INSHADOW1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1497, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15INSHADOW1/15INSHADOW1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15INSHADOW1/15INSHADOW1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/arts/15INSHADOW1/15INSHADOW1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 15