 an experiment I’m posting my tweets about it here.', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/14/my-take-on-the-republican-presidential-debate/', 'snippet': 'Republican candidates for president dueled in another televised debate, the modern version of gladiatorial combat. As an experiment I’m posting my tweets about it here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Republican candidates for president dueled in another televised debate, the modern version of gladiatorial combat. Instead of writing a column, I’m collecting some of my tweets about the debate in this blog post, which I’m updating until it ends. These are raw and rushed ruminations, journalism on the fly, but it’s an attempt to hold politicians accountable instantaneously for their rhetorical stretches. I welcome your comments.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/opinion/14kristofWeb/14kristofWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/15/opinion/14kristofWeb/14kristofWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/opinion/14kristofWeb/14kristofWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 641, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/opinion/14kristofWeb/14kristofWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1281, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/opinion/14kristofWeb/14kristofWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'imag