 Scott lying across a chair, a tableau of New York’s female gallerists — even the Kardashian-Wests mid-selfie. From a third screen glows the Queen in formal pomp.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Annie Leibovitz’s Classic Portraits of Women, Now in Expanded Form', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Leibovitz, Annie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-15T19:11:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Art', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hettie Judah', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hettie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Judah', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/388f3cc1-9c4b-5bcd-9105-d5543656984c', 'word_count': 847, 'uri': 'nyt://article/388f3cc1-9c4b-5bcd-9105-d5543656984c'}, {'abstract': 'A conventional ad has emerged from Mr. Trump’s unconventional campaign, but its upbeat message may help with evangelical voters uneasy with his combative style.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/16/us/politics/new-donald-trump-ad-features-less-anger-bold-goals-and-no-specifics.html', 'snippet': 'A conventional ad has emerged from Mr. Trump’s unconventional campaign, but its upbeat message may help with evangelical voters uneasy with his combative style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald J. Trump’s campaign on Friday released its second advertisement, a conventional 30-second clip of Mr. Trump’s Jan. 4 stump speech in Lowell, Mass.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Donald Trump Ad Features Less Anger, Bold Goals and No Specifics', 'kicker':