dozens of security forces who began a counterattack hours later. It was Al Qaeda’s first major attack in this landlocked sub-Saharan country, a former French colony.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16BURKINA/16BURKINA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16BURKINA/16BURKINA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16BURKINA/16BURKINA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16BURKINA/16BURKINA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1320, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16BURKINA/16BURKINA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16BURKINA/16BURKINA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16BURKINA/16BURKINA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At Least 20 Killed in Siege by Militants in Burkina Faso', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jihadists Strike Another Tourist Site, This Time in West Africa ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name'