e-spirits.html', 'snippet': 'If there’s a revolution in fashion, it’s about men’s wear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If there’s a revolution in fashion, it’s about men’s wear. Shown here are men who won’t be corralled by traditional style expectations. Two looks are at the center: a pencil-slim wrap coat in an unconventional gray, left, and a dusty pink coat shaped by exaggerated welt seams, right. The effect is such that the cloth seems to have been molded into a fitted shape. More important is the authority with which the young men wear these coats, which are far removed from the expected Wall Street uniform.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham |\xa0Free Spirits', 'kicker': 'On the Street', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Free Spirits', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coats and Jackets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-15T22:42:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Cunningham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cunningham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0ddf498-0a2b-5eef-b266-789474b00173', 'word_count': 92, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0ddf498-0a2b-5eef-b266-789474b00173'}, {'abstract': 'Get recommendations from New York Times reporters and editors, highlighting great stories from around the web. Today, interesting reads from Lynda Richardson, Andrew Ja