quick release of the sailors was a benefit of nuclear diplomacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The White House on Friday sought to defuse attempts by President Obama’s critics to turn this week’s overnight seizure of two American patrol boats and their crews into a symbol of what they say are the administration’s foreign policy failures and feckless relations with Iran.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16SHIPS/16SHIPS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 321, 'width': 500, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16SHIPS/16SHIPS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 321, 'width': 500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16SHIPS/16SHIPS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16SHIPS/16SHIPS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/world/16SHIPS/16SHIPS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Addressing Critics, White House Cites Diplomacy in Release of Sailors by Iran', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Addressing Critics, White House Cites Diplomacy in Release of Sailors by Iran', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmitt, Eric', 'rank': 2, '