isans display their works alongside pieces made by their counterparts of centuries ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/17/nyregion/at-fairfield-museum-exploring-craftsmanship-across-centuries.html', 'snippet': 'In an exhibition at the Fairfield Museum, contemporary artisans display their works alongside pieces made by their counterparts of centuries ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this era of mass-produced goods, when we can breezily purchase dishes and glassware by the set, browse for presized rugs online and “build” furniture by assembling kits from Ikea, it’s easy to take such quotidian household items for granted. But just a couple of centuries ago, the only way to create them was to fashion them by hand.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/17/nyregion/17ARTSCT2/17ARTSCT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/17/nyregion/17ARTSCT2/17ARTSCT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/17/nyregion/17ARTSCT2/17ARTSCT2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/17/nyregion/17ARTSCT2/17ARTSCT2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/17/nyregion/17ARTSCT2/17ARTSCT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/17/nyregion/17ARTSCT2/17ARTSCT2-thum