de Amy Schumer” have led him to a good-guy part in “Billions.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/17/arts/television/paul-giamatti-had-a-busy-year-of-mad-guys-and-bad-hair.html', 'snippet': 'Roles as music-biz manipulators in “Love & Mercy” and “Straight Outta Compton” and as an angry juror on “Inside Amy Schumer” have led him to a good-guy part in “Billions.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Paul Giamatti is first seen in the new Showtime drama “Billions,” his character, a crusading United States attorney named Chuck Rhoades, has been bound and gagged as part of a sadomasochistic sex act. Shooting the scene last year had a curious effect on the actor. “I got really sleepy and relaxed,” Mr. Giamatti recently recalled over a cappuccino at the Lambs Club in Times Square. “I think guys who normally get tied up have the opposite reaction. Or maybe this is why they swaddle babies?”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/17/arts/17BILLIONS1/17BILLIONS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/17/arts/17BILLIONS1/17BILLIONS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/17/arts/17BILLIONS1/17BILLIONS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/17/arts/17BILLIONS1/17BILLIONS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1315, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/17/arts/17BILLIONS1/17BILLIONS1-thumbStandard