sed-door meeting Friday, a Jeb Bush donor questioned why the group Right to Rise was spending money attacking Senator Marco Rubio.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/01/16/prominent-jeb-bush-donor-questions-how-bush-aligned-super-pac-spends-its-money/', 'snippet': 'At a closed-door meeting Friday, a Jeb Bush donor questioned why the group Right to Rise was spending money attacking Senator Marco Rubio.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A prominent donor to Jeb Bush pressed the chief strategist of the “super PAC” supporting Mr. Bush over the group’s negative ads about Senator Marco Rubio during a closed-door meeting in Manhattan on Friday, according to three people familiar with the encounter.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/us/donor-firstdraft/donor-firstdraft-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/16/us/donor-firstdraft/donor-firstdraft-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/us/donor-firstdraft/donor-firstdraft-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/us/donor-firstdraft/donor-firstdraft-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/16/us/donor-firstdraft/donor-firstdraft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/16/us/donor-firstdraft/donor-firstdraft-thumbStandar