is week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/18/business/treasury-auctions-set-for-the-week-of-jan-18.html', 'snippet': 'The following tax-exempt fixed-income issues are scheduled for pricing this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Treasury’s schedule of financing includes the regular weekly auction of new three- and six-month bills, which will be held Tuesday as the markets will be closed Monday for Martin Luther King’s Birthday. The regular four-week bill auction will be moved to Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Treasury Auctions Set for the Week of Jan. 18', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Treasury Auctions Set for This Week', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Municipal Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Credits, Deductions and Exemptions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Treasury Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-17T23:26:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fea1b4cf-269c-5701-92f7-b7f4d1c972c6', 'word_count': 467, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fea1b4cf-269c-5701-92f7-b7f4d1c972c6'}, {'abstract': 'Supporters of Mr. Sanders attended church with him and sought to present his stances on race and the economy as an extension of the views of the Rev. Dr. Martin Luther King Jr.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/01/17/bernie-sanders-supporters-invoke-martin-luther-king-jr/', 'snippet': 'Supporters of Mr. Sanders attended church with him and sought to present his stances on race and the economy as an extension of the views of the Rev. Dr. Martin Luther King Jr.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NORTH CHARLESTON, S.C. — On the eve of