 his country, was killed in airstrikes outside Sana while on assignment for Voice of America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SANA, Yemen — For Almigdad Mojalli, a Yemeni journalist covering the civil war in his country, the trip early Sunday to the site of a deadly airstrike was another episode in what had long since become a painful routine.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Covering War at Home Costs a Yemeni His Life', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Covering War at Home Costs a Yemeni His Life', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fahim, Kareem', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yemen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mojalli, Almigdad', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Almosawa, Shuaib', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Committee to Protect Journalists', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Voice of America', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-18T00:57:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shuaib Almosawa and Kareem Fahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shuaib', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Almosawa', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Kareem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/10448444-b479-59f6-b614-d2847fbd955d