an 10 million viewers tuned in to watch the Democratic presidential debate on Sunday night, a big jump over the party’s two most recent debates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/01/18/viewership-for-democratic-debate-increased-to-more-than-10-million-nbc-says/', 'snippet': 'More than 10 million viewers tuned in to watch the Democratic presidential debate on Sunday night, a big jump over the party’s two most recent debates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The increasingly close race between Hillary Clinton and Senator Bernie Sanders is capturing the attention of the American electorate, according to NBC, which said that more than 10 million viewers tuned in to watch the Democratic presidential debate on Sunday night. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/us/18firstdraft-debate/18firstdraft-debate-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/19/us/18firstdraft-debate/18firstdraft-debate-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/us/18firstdraft-debate/18firstdraft-debate-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/us/18firstdraft-debate/18firstdraft-debate-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/us/18firstdraft-debate/18firstdraft-debate-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/