rnment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — As president of the European Council — the group representing the European Union’s often-clashing 28 leaders — Donald Tusk is forever promoting a balance between national sovereignty on one hand and common values and goals on the other. On Monday, his challenge was especially personal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Polish E.U. Leader Seeks Middle Ground in a Dispute With Poland', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Commission', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tusk, Donald', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Poland', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duda, Andrzej (1972- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Law and Justice (Poland)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-18T21:19:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Kanter and Rick Lyman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kanter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29d06489-d2e6-56f6-b402-d35037f12223', 'word_count': 1010, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29d06489-d2e6-56f6-b402-d35037f12223'}, {'abstract': 'The president’s measure to address persistent joblessness and stagnation was immediately seized on by critics as having more political than economic meaning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/19/business/int