ard by the slowing economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/20/world/asia/china-guangdong-economy.html', 'snippet': 'After the sudden closure of a shoe factory, a migrant worker heads back to his home in the countryside. China has been hit hard by the slowing economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Liu Lang, a Chinese migrant worker, left his rural hometown in Sichuan Province two decades ago to work in the factories of the southern province of Guangdong, China’s manufacturing powerhouse. Now, he is moving back.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'His Factory Job Gone, a Chinese Migrant Worker Returns Home', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Guangdong Province (China)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-19T06:45:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonah M. Kessel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c1cb1eff-75f8-513b-9be2-b08faff729b4', 'word_count': 172, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c1cb1eff-75f8-513b-9be2-b08faff729b4'}, {'abstract': 'Lesson for aspiring engineers in a fiery failure on the path to routine commercial rocket launches.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/19/breaking-things-including-rocket-stages-on-the-path-to-breakthroughs/', 'snippet': 'Lesson for aspiring engineers in a fiery failure on the path to routine commercia