oard', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/3498f040-eec1-595f-852c-5c0d4b1b0428', 'word_count': 727, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3498f040-eec1-595f-852c-5c0d4b1b0428'}, {'abstract': 'A new bill would further stigmatize and denigrate gay people.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/19/opinion/fueling-homophobia-in-russia.html', 'snippet': 'A new bill would further stigmatize and denigrate gay people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A vaguely written “gay propaganda” law passed in 2013 created a toxic environment for gay men and lesbians in Russia. Now, some lawmakers want to further denigrate and stigmatize gay people. A new bill scheduled for debate on Friday in the lower house of Parliament would allow the authorities to impose fines and even jail time for public displays of affection between people of the same sex.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/18/opinion/EDrussian/EDrussian-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/18/opinion/EDrussian/EDrussian-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/18/opinion/EDrussian/EDrussian-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/18/opinion/EDrussian/EDrussian-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/18/opinion/EDrussian/EDrussian-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/18/opinion/EDrussian/EDrussian-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/18/opinion/EDrussian/EDrussian-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fueling Homophobia in Russia', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fueling Homophobia in Russia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hate Crimes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Propaganda', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-19T08:21:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/a88b8868-d358-50ad-8d2f-e58978dc9f62', 'word_count': 396, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a88b8868-d358-50ad-8d2f-e58978dc9f62'}, {'abstract': 'Immigrants working in the fields endure a nightmare of sexual violence, and it’s rare for their attackers to be prosecuted.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/19/opinion/how-to-protect-female-farmworkers.html', 'snippet': 'Immigrants working in the fields endure a nightmare of sexual violence, and it’s rare for their attackers to be prosecuted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Oakland, Calif. — ACROSS the country, some 400,000 women, mostly immigrants, work in agriculture, toiling in fields, nurseries and packing plants. Such work is backbreaking and low-paying. But for many of these women, it is also a nightmare of sexual violence.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19padillabacon/19padillabacon-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19padillabacon/19padillabacon-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19padillabacon/19padillabacon-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19padillabacon/19padillabacon-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1375, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19padillabacon/19padillabacon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19padillabacon/19padillabacon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19padillabacon/19padillabacon-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Protect Female Farmworkers', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Protect Female Farmworkers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bacon, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Migrant Labor (Agriculture)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Padilla, Jose R', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-19T08:21:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By José R. Padilla and David Bacon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'José', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Padilla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bacon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/4622f2a1-a071-566d-911a-7cccaf06372f', 'word_count': 808, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4622f2a1-a071-566d-911a-7cccaf06372f'}, {'abstract': 'The goal of treatment is to show you this — not to make you feel more secure or comforted.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/19/you-are-stronger-than-you-think/', 'snippet': 'The goal of treatment is to show you this — not to make you feel more secure or comforted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m a psychiatrist who has spent most of the past 30 years treating patients with moderate to severe mental illness. But I’ve also administered care for the Massachusetts Department of Mental Health, Harvard Medical School and several insurance companies, and so I’m often asked for advice by colleagues who feel their patients need more help than an insurer is willing to pay for. In addition to offering technical advice, I often become, in essence, the therapists’ therapist, at least in terms of their treatment choices. And sometimes those interactions are as intense as therapy itself. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19couchWeb/19couchWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19couchWeb/19couchWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 452}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19couchWeb/19couchWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19couchWeb/19couchWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1543, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19couchWeb/19couchWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19couchWeb/19couchWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/19/opinion/19couchWeb/19couchWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'You Are Stronger Than You (and Your Therapist) Think', 'kicker': 'Couch', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anxiety and Stress', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 