b592faa8'}, {'abstract': 'The bank says it is planning to exit entire areas of the fixed-income business that are “not strategically significant.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/20/business/dealbook/morgan-stanley-posts-profit-as-it-details-new-strategy.html', 'snippet': 'The bank says it is planning to exit entire areas of the fixed-income business that are “not strategically significant.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Morgan Stanley swung from a loss to a better-than-expected profit in the fourth quarter compared to a year ago — at the same time that it announced a new strategic plan for improving profitability even more.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/20/business/20db-morgan/20db-morgan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/20/business/20db-morgan/20db-morgan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/20/business/20db-morgan/20db-morgan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/20/business/20db-morgan/20db-morgan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/20/business/20db-morgan/20db-morgan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/20/business/20db-morgan/20db-morgan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank'