 up, ostensibly to help them “die with dignity.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Unequal Lives, Unequal Deaths', 'kicker': 'The End', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Death and Dying', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospice Care', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-20T09:45:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sunita Puri', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sunita', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Puri', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee5e6677-781b-5ddb-aa35-24cd5a85e8cf', 'word_count': 1690, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee5e6677-781b-5ddb-aa35-24cd5a85e8cf'}, {'abstract': 'The major indexes in the United States were all down more than 3 percent but then staged a turnaround in the final hour.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/21/business/international/us-stock-markets-dow-sp-global-indexes.html', 'snippet': 'The major indexes in the United States were all down more than 3 percent but then staged a turnaround in the final hour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Soon after midday on Wednesday, panic selling seemed to be seizing the United States stock market.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/21/business/21MARKETSsub/21MARKETSsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 926, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/21/business/21MARKETSsub/21MA