r” books that have captivated him since childhood.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24GUIDE9/24GUIDE9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24GUIDE9/24GUIDE9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24GUIDE9/24GUIDE9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24GUIDE9/24GUIDE9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24GUIDE9/24GUIDE9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24GUIDE9/24GUIDE9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24GUIDE9/24GUIDE9-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘The Magicians,’ Based on Lev Grossman’s Fantasy Trilogy, on Syfy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Television; Grad School, for a Spell', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Syfy Channel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Magicians (TV Program)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grossman, Lev', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ralph, Jason (Actor)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-20T15:57:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/214f3efb-5e24-5ed3-a9ff-4f70da651c87', 'word_count': 166, 'uri': 'nyt://article/214f3efb-5e24-5ed3-a9ff-4f70da651c87'}, {'abstract': 'The Weeknd and Little Big Town will also play the ceremony, on Feb. 15, but organizers haven’t announced plans for a David Bowie tribute yet.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/20/adele-kendrick-lamar-grammy-performers/', 'snippet': 'The Weeknd and Little Big Town will also play the ceremony, on Feb. 15, but organizers haven’t announced plans for a David Bowie tribute yet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Adele, Kendrick Lamar, the Weeknd and Little Big Town will be among the performers at the 58th annual Grammy Awards ceremony on Feb. 15, the show’s organizers announced on Wednesday morning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2016 Grammy Awards Performers Include Adele and Kendrick Lamar', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grammy Awards', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Records and Achievements', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adele (Singer)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lama