works and performances by an international roster of eight artists is in Long Island City, Queens.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/24/arts/design/the-eccentrics-reveals-offbeat-modes-of-being-at-sculpture-center.html', 'snippet': 'This circuslike exhibition of artworks and performances by an international roster of eight artists is in Long Island City, Queens.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Russia, “eccentric” is a word for circus performer, a figure seen by the writer Walter Benjamin as an avatar of creative deviance. Following Benjamin’s lead, the SculptureCenter curator, Ruba Katrib, has organized “The Eccentrics,” a circuslike exhibition of artworks and performances by an international roster of eight artists that promises to reveal novel, offbeat and liberating modes of being. It opens on Sunday, Jan. 24, in Long Island City, Queens.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘The Eccentrics’ Reveals Offbeat Modes of Being at SculptureCenter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Art; Novel and Offbeat Modes of Being', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sculpture', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SculptureCenter', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Eccentrics (Exhibit)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Katrib, Ruba', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-20T16:21:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f4f3dbb-a068-57c2-9c34-6a2aa4933f6b', 'word_count': 155, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f4f3dbb-a068-57c2-9c34-6a2aa4933f6b'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: College students face being drafted for Vietnam in 1966.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/20/1966-college-students-face-draft/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: College students face being drafted for Vietnam in 1966.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — College students will be drafted beginning next fall unless peace comes in Vietnam, the director of the Selective Service system announced last night [Jan 19]. Lt. Gen. Lewis B. Hershey’s grim statement directly affects the 2.2 million students now holding college deferments. Under present Selective Service policies, college students are merely required to be doing satisfactory work while enrolled full-time at a properly accredited college or university to escape the draft.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Jan. 21, 1966', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/20/blogs/20iht-oldjan20-vietnam/20iht-oldjan20-vietnam-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 510, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/20/blogs/20iht-oldjan20-vietnam/20iht-oldjan20-vietnam-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 510, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/20/blogs/20iht-oldjan20-vietnam/20iht-oldjan20-vietnam-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/20/blogs/20iht-oldjan20-vietnam/20iht-oldjan20-vietnam-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/20/blogs/20iht-oldjan20-vietnam/20iht-oldjan20-vietnam-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1966: College Students Face Draft', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Military)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vietnam War', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-20T16:22:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/094e17b8-ffe8-5d9d-a191-392dd1c67536', 'word_count': 82, 'uri': 'nyt://article/094e17b8-ffe8-5d9d-a191-392dd1c67536'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Cruz became known among his fellow clerks for his death penalty advocacy and for dwelling on the lurid details of murders in his case summaries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/21/us/politics/as-supreme-court-clerk-ted-cruz-made-death-penalty-his-cause.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Cruz became known among his fellow clerks for his death penalty advocacy and for dwelling on the lurid details of murders in his case summaries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The memos of Supreme Court clerks evaluating death row petitions usually consist of a brief review of the facts and then a dispassionate legal analysis as to whether the court should hear the case.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_p