sea townhouse that was occupied by Louise Bourgeois.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Look Inside the Louise Bourgeois House, Just How She Left It', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Artist’s Home, How She Left It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lubow, Arthur', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bourgeois, Louise', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chelsea (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-20T18:24:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Arthur Lubow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Arthur', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lubow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/69411cf3-546c-5478-8fe8-f06ddd7d9d32', 'word_count': 1509, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69411cf3-546c-5478-8fe8-f06ddd7d9d32'}, {'abstract': 'The ad is intended to undercut Mr. Cruz’s efforts to present himself as a true, unwavering conservative, and focuses on his changing stances on immigration, refugees, ethanol and trade.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/21/us/politics/marco-rubio-super-pac-portrays-ted-cruz-as-fickle.html', 'snippet': 'The ad is intended to undercut Mr. Cruz’s efforts to present himself as a true, unwavering conservative, and focuses on his changing stances on immigration, refugees, ethanol and trade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The “super PAC” supporting Senator Marco Rubio of Florida has turned its sights on Senator Ted Cruz of Texas, releasing two ads with companion websites attacking 