ty to pass revenue-related bills.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/21/us/republicans-gain-edge-with-vote-to-unseat-mississippi-democrat.html', 'snippet': 'A veteran Democratic lawmaker was removed from office by a Republican-dominated House on a technicality, giving Republicans the ability to pass revenue-related bills.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — First, the re-election bid of State Representative Blaine Eaton II of Mississippi ended in a statistically improbable tie. Then — bizarrely, but in keeping with Mississippi statute — the outcome was decided by a drawing of straws, which he won.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Republicans Unseat Mississippi Democrat Who Drew Winning Straw After Race Ended in Tie', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Republicans Unseat Mississippi Democrat After Race Ended in Tie', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mississippi', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eaton, Blaine II (1967- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tullos, Mark K 1965- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-21T01:51:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Fausset and Alan Blinder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fausset', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Blinder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/524c0d0e-de7f-5908-bfd1-4885a35a3510', 'word_count': 596, 'uri': 'nyt://article/524c0d0e-de7f-5908-bfd1-4885a35a3510'}, 