has been testing several strategies to dent Mr. Trump’s popularity. But true to form, Mr. Trump has complicated his path.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/21/us/politics/donald-trump-is-forcing-ted-cruz-to-rewrite-his-playbook.html', 'snippet': 'On the campaign trail, Mr. Cruz has been testing several strategies to dent Mr. Trump’s popularity. But true to form, Mr. Trump has complicated his path.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHITEFIELD, N.H. — Ted Cruz did not have to say a cross word about Scott Walker. Rick Perry and Bobby Jindal faded on their own. And when Ben Carson briefly rocketed to the top of the Iowa polls, Mr. Cruz and his team stayed cool, confident that the neurosurgeon’s support would wither.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/21/us/JPCAMPAIGN/JPCAMPAIGN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/21/us/JPCAMPAIGN/JPCAMPAIGN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 432}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/21/us/JPCAMPAIGN/JPCAMPAIGN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/21/us/JPCAMPAIGN/JPCAMPAIGN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1474, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/21/us/JPCAMPAIGN/JPCAMPAIGN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/21/us/JPCAMPAIGN/JPCAMPAIGN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 7