 beginning of the road for this moody New York and Massachusetts electro-R&B trio. After building buzz last year with a barrage of immaculate singles and appearing on “The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon,” the band will release its debut album, “Don’t You,” on Friday, Jan. 29, on Columbia Records. It will also tour the United States and Europe, with stops at the Bowery Ballroom on Jan. 28 and Rough Trade in Brooklyn on Jan. 29; unannounced major festival dates are looming on the horizon.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT/24SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT/24SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT/24SNAPSHOT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT/24SNAPSHOT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT/24SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT/24SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT/24SNAPSHOT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150