-chances.html', 'snippet': 'In her concert, which opened Lincoln Center’s American Songbook series, Ms. Williams projected the persona of a hard-working, self-possessed entertainer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Vanessa Williams operates in so many arenas, it has always been difficult to figure out who she really is — beyond being an attractive, disciplined, highly competent singer and actor who seems equally comfortable in front of a camera, in a recording studio and on the stage. In her 90-minute concert on Wednesday evening at the Appel Room, which opened Lincoln Center’s American Songbook series, the persona she projected was a hard-working, self-possessed entertainer with a clear perspective on her show business lineage.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/22/arts/22WILLIAMS/22WILLIAMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/22/arts/22WILLIAMS/22WILLIAMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/22/arts/22WILLIAMS/22WILLIAMS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/22/arts/22WILLIAMS/22WILLIAMS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1178, 'width': 1767, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/22/arts/22WILLIAMS/22WILLIAMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/22/arts/22WILLIAMS/22WILLIAMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 