rica/un-finds-south-sudan-increasingly-in-turmoil.html', 'snippet': 'A 45-page United Nations report describes a murderous struggle between government and opposition forces that includes disturbing new levels of sexual violence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — The murderous struggle between the government and opposition forces in South Sudan has already resulted in widespread atrocities and left thousands of people on the brink of starvation, yet in the past year, both sides intensified and spread the conflict, the United Nations said Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Finds South Sudan Increasingly in Turmoil', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Finds South Sudan Increasingly in Turmoil', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cumming-Bruce, Nick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Sudan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Machar, Riek', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kiir Mayardit, Salva', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Soldiers', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-22T01:53:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Cumming-Bruce', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cumming-Bruce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role':