/8195a6b3-75db-55d2-8ad8-73fa1cd67d85'}, {'abstract': 'There’s always talk about designers stepping out on their own, but the former Lanvin designer actually might be able to do it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/23/fashion/fashion-wants-alber-elbaz-to-start-his-own-line.html', 'snippet': 'There’s always talk about designers stepping out on their own, but the former Lanvin designer actually might be able to do it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What should the former Lanvin designer Alber Elbaz do next? As men’s wear goes into high gear in Paris and the city prepares for couture, that is a question that keeps coming up. Though there was a movement last fall, in the immediate wake of his firing, to draft him to be creative director of Christian Dior, the post left vacant by Raf Simons, that talk has died down, and there is now a groundswell of support for him starting his own line.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/23/fashion/23OTR-A/23OTR-A-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/23/fashion/23OTR-A/23OTR-A-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/23/fashion/23OTR-A/23OTR-A-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/23/fashion/23OTR-A/23OTR-A-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/23/fashion/23OTR-A/23OTR-A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/23/fashion/23OTR-A/23OTR-A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/23/fashion/23OTR-A/23OTR-A-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fashion Wants Alber Elbaz to Start His Own Line', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elbaz, Alber', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lanvin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-22T13:43:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vanessa Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vanessa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/24070ac9-7166-531a-ac69-68fbda808d6f', 'word_count': 663, 'uri': 'nyt://article/24070ac9-7166-531a-ac69-68fbda808d6f'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: British armed forces number 4 million men in 1941', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/22/1941-british-forces-at-4-million-men/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: British armed forces number 4 million men in 1941', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Declaring that the size of the army was at the root of all questions of man power, Prime Minister Winston Churchill revealed to the House of Commons today [Jan. 22] that the British Empire’s armed forces, including the Home Guard, now numbered 4,000,000 men. This army, he explained, was ‘‘a very large and formidable force, both fighting overseas and for defense.’’ Great Britain’s vast industrial establishment, he continued, had been set up in 1939 to provide the army with ‘‘all the equipment it required in continuous action on the Continent of Europe against the German enemy.’’ ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1941: British Forces at 4 Million Men', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Churchill, Winston Leonard Spencer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-22T14:01:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43990c4a-9134-5e0f-aefe-3268c037792b', 'word_count': 168, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43990c4a-9134-5e0f-aefe-3268c037792b'}, {'abstract': 'Millions of people along the East Coast braced for travel disruptions and possible power losses. In some areas, as much as two feet of snow may fall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/23/us/blizzard-east-coast.html', 'snippet': 'Millions of people along the East Coast braced for travel disruptions and possible power losses. In some areas, as much as two feet of snow may fall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A massive winter storm that threatens to dump two feet of snow on the nation’s capital began pummeling the East Coast on Friday afternoon, as millions of people from the Carolinas to New York braced for a weekend of severe winds, power losses and coastal flooding. Thousands of flights were canceled; governors and mayors warned people to stay indoors and off the roads.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dire Warnings Along East Coast as Snow Piles Up', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dire Warnings Along East Coast as Snow Piles Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Coast (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-22T14:02:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheryl Gay Stolberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheryl', 'middlename': 'Gay', 'lastname': 'Stolberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ae785b82-eb1a-5562-ae4c-7edc20898001', 'word_count': 1224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae785b82-eb1a-5562-ae4c-7edc20898001'}, {'abstract': 'The president of Google for Work says it’s important to create a culture where people can present diverse points of view.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/24/technology/amit-singh-of-google-for-work-a-respectful-clash-of-ideas.html', 'snippet': 'The president of Google for Work says it’s important to create a culture where people can present diverse points of view.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This interview with Amit Singh, president of Google for Work, was conducted and condensed by Adam Bryant', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/business/24CORNERSUB/24C