anies are postponing initial offerings in the face of an uncertain stock market, given the ready availability of private investment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/23/business/dealbook/a-new-year-chill-on-ipos.html', 'snippet': 'Prospective public companies are postponing initial offerings in the face of an uncertain stock market, given the ready availability of private investment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAVOS, Switzerland — The market for initial public offerings has been all but dead since late last year. Don’t expect that freeze to lift anytime soon, according to two top officials for the United States’ biggest stock exchanges.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Year Chill on I.P.O.s', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Stock Exchange', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NASDAQ OMX Group Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-22T19:25:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac2d4faa-1b88-5887-b8d4-b37a453d726e', 'word_count': 333, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac2d4faa-1b88-5887-b8d4-b37a453d726e'}, {'abstract': 'Glenn Adamson, director of the Museum of Arts and Design in Manhattan, has announced he will be stepping down.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/22/director-of-manhattans-museum-of-arts-