ined a new suspect in the attacks in Paris and had released one who had been previously detained. But it said it would still require the man who was released to appear before a judge and limit his activities.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Suspect in Paris Attacks Is Detained, Belgian Officials Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Suspect in Paris Attacks Is Detained by Belgians', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Attacks (November 2015)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubin, Alissa Johannsen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belgium', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abdeslam, Mohamed', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abdeslam, Salah', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aitboulahcen, Hasna', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brussels (Belgium)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-22T21:30:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alissa J. Rubin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alissa', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Rubin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/066e0153-3b98-5395-b280-e5b955231a5e', 'word_count': 667, 'uri': 'nyt://article/066e0153-3b98-5395-b280-e5b955231a5e'}, {'abstract': 'A scientific consensus that deflation of footballs in the 2015 A.F.C. title game could be explained by physics has not done anything to mitigate the Patriots’ punishment.', 'web_url': 'http