ion of Sumner Redstone, executive chairman of Viacom, was needed to obtain sufficient evidence in a case questioning his mental competence.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/23/business/media/judge-orders-medical-examination-of-sumner-redstone.html', 'snippet': 'In a reversal, a judge said the examination of Sumner Redstone, executive chairman of Viacom, was needed to obtain sufficient evidence in a case questioning his mental competence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A California judge has ordered the ailing 92-year-old media mogul Sumner M. Redstone to undergo a medical examination, a major development in the continuing legal battle over his mental competence.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/23/business/23Viacom/23Viacom-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 631, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/23/business/23Viacom/23Viacom-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 631}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/23/business/23Viacom/23Viacom-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 974, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/23/business/23Viacom/23Viacom-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1948, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/23/business/23Viacom/23Viacom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/23/business/23Viacom/23Viacom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank'