s-public-editor.html', 'snippet': 'As voters prepare to cast their first ballots, a look at how The Times is covering the race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When you’re Donald Trump, bashing The New York Times must always seem like a good idea.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Facts, Fairness, and the Election\xad', 'kicker': 'The Public Editor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Facts, Fairness, and the Election\xad', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sullivan, Margaret M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Public Editor (Times Column)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-23T19:30:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Public Editor', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margaret Sullivan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margaret', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sullivan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/b440b925-9185-58d1-8dfb-88ab96506134', 'word_count': 1256, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b440b925-9185-58d1-8dfb-88ab96506134'}, {'abstract': 'International observers could play a crucial role as the country’s largest guerrilla group lays down its arms.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/24/opinion/un-can-seal-the-peace-in-colombia.html', 'snippet': 'International observers could play a crucial role as the country’s largest guerrilla group lays down its arms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The government of Colombia and the country’s largest guerrilla group have made an unusual joint request to the United Nations Security Council. Nearing the final stages of an armistice negotiation, the two