 bus carrying the men’s basketball team became stranded on the Pennsylvania Turnpike on Friday night and was not freed for more than 22 hours.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/24/sports/ncaabasketball/duquesne-basketball-team-stuck-on-turnpike-plays-cards-and-makes-a-snow-angel.html', 'snippet': 'The bus carrying the men’s basketball team became stranded on the Pennsylvania Turnpike on Friday night and was not freed for more than 22 hours.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the team bus lurched to a halt around 9:15 p.m. Friday, Brian Baudinet, the player development coach of the Duquesne men’s basketball team, assumed that an accident on the Pennsylvania Turnpike had caused the disruption.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Duquesne Basketball Team, Stuck on Turnpike, Plays Cards and Makes a Snow Angel', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Snow Angels and Twitter Cheer a Stranded Team ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Buses', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Duquesne University', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-23T21:54:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Schonbrun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schonbrun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/51e766a9-c508-5cb1-ba0c-88e0cfb10300', 'word_count': 775, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51e766a9-c508-5cb1-ba0c-88e0cfb10300'}, {'abstract': 'For much of New York’s labor force — including police officers, nurses, plow drivers, bartenders and shopkeepers — the blizzard meant anything but a snow day.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/24/nyregion/for-many-workers-staying-home-is-not-an-option-as-snowstorm-batters-city.html', 'snippet': 'For much of New York’s labor force — including police officers, nurses, plow drivers, bartenders and shopkeepers — the blizzard meant anything but a snow day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There were the workers who boarded a Manhattan-bound subway train before sunrise in boots and denim shirts, looking for a place to sit between the men sprawled out and sleeping on the benches who had no other place to spend the night.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/nyregion/24workers-web/24workers-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/24/nyregion/24workers-web/24workers-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/nyregion/24workers-web/24workers-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/nyregion/24workers-web/24workers-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/24/nyregion/24workers-web/24workers-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/24/nyregion/24