, 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/25/technology/twitter-to-appoint-new-board-members-and-chief-marketing-officer.html', 'snippet': 'The social networking company will undergo a major overhaul of its top ranks in the next few weeks, from its eight-member board to key executives in engineering and product.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jack Dorsey began his tenure last year as Twitter’s chief executive with layoffs and a string of new personnel appointments. It turned out those moves were just a prelude.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/03/nytnow/25twitter-web1/02nytnow-dorsey-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 438, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/10/03/nytnow/25twitter-web1/02nytnow-dorsey-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 438}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/03/nytnow/25twitter-web1/02nytnow-dorsey-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 748, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/03/nytnow/25twitter-web1/02nytnow-dorsey-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1497, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/03/nytnow/25twitter-web1/02nytnow-dorsey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/10/03/nytnow/25twitter-web1/02nytnow-dorsey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/03/nytnow/25twitter-web1/02nytnow-dorsey-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Jack Dorsey Tries to Reshape Twitter, Revolving Door Takes Another Spin', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Twitter’s Revolving Door Takes Another Spin', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dorsey, Jack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-24T20:39:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Isaac', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Isaac', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e70fdb8a-19ee-5960-a4de-896db39aca13', 'word_count': 750, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e70fdb8a-19ee-5960-a4de-896db39aca13'}, {'abstract': 'The video appears aimed at making it clear that the assailants — nearly all of whom had European passports — had been carrying out atrocities in the group’s name long before their return into Europe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/25/world/middleeast/isis-video-paris-attacks.html', 'snippet': 'The video appears aimed at making it clear that the assailants — nearly all of whom had European passports — had been carrying out atrocities in the group’s name long before their return into Europe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The Islamic State released a video on Sunday apparently showing footage of the men who carried out the November attacks in Paris while they were in Syria and Iraq, where they are pictured carrying out executions, including beheadings.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'ISIS Video Appears to Show Paris Assailants Earlier in Syria and Iraq', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'ISIS Video Appears to Show Paris Assailants Earlier in Syria and Iraq', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Attacks (November 2015)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-24T20:56:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rukmini Callimachi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rukmini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Callimachi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e7763b5-6780-5736-93d8-4fee649ee924', 'word_count': 775, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e7763b5-6780-5736-93d8-4fee649ee924'}, {'abstract': 'Years after a similar effort failed, lawmakers are confronting an issue that remains a wide divide between Italy and most of the rest of the West.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/25/world/europe/italy-divided-over-effort-to-legalize-civil-unions-for-gays.html', 'snippet': 'Years after a similar effort failed, lawmakers are confronting an issue that remains a wide divide between Italy and most of the rest of the West.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — Six years ago, Andrea Rubera married his partner in Canada, where the couple later became parents of three young children. But when they returned to their native Italy, a transformation occurred. Mr. Rubera suddenly became a single man, and his legally recognized husband in Canada became his single male roommate in Italy. Italian law also divided custody of their children.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/25/world/25ITALY2/25ITALY2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/25/world/25ITALY2/25ITALY2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/25/world/25ITALY2/25ITALY2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/25/world/25ITALY2/25ITALY2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/25/world/25ITALY2/25ITALY2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/25/world/25ITALY2/25ITALY2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/25/world/25ITALY2/25ITALY2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Italy Divided Over Effort to Le