was largely spared by Hurricane Sandy, suffered the most severe flooding in the state during the weekend blizzard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/25/nyregion/southern-jersey-shore-hit-with-severe-flooding-by-snowstorms-high-tides.html', 'snippet': 'The southern end of the Jersey Shore, which was largely spared by Hurricane Sandy, suffered the most severe flooding in the state during the weekend blizzard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The southern end of the Jersey Shore, which was largely spared by Hurricane Sandy three years ago, had the most severe flooding in the state during the weekend blizzard, as high tides sent icy water rushing into darkened homes and businesses.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Southern Jersey Shore Hit With Severe Flooding by Snowstorm’s High Tides', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'High Tides Wreak Havoc on Southern Jersey Shore', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGeehan, Patrick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Floods', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hurdle, Jon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Power Failures and Blackouts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-25T00:57:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick McGeehan and Jon Hurdle', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGeehan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'