id were by master artists, including a purported Rothko purchased by Domenico and Eleanore De Sole for $8.3 million in 2004.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/26/arts/trials-begins-in-art-forgery-case-against-knoedler-gallery.html', 'snippet': 'The gallery is accused of selling dozens of fake works that it said were by master artists, including a purported Rothko purchased by Domenico and Eleanore De Sole for $8.3 million in 2004.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Perhaps the most anticipated trial exploring the art market in recent years began Monday in United States District Court in Manhattan with a lawyer for a couple that bought a fake Rothko asserting in her opening argument that Knoedler & Company, a once-celebrated Manhattan gallery that is now defunct, had deceived its customers while selling them dozens of fake works that it said were by master artists.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/25/arts/25KNOEDLER/25KNOEDLER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 299, 'width': 242, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/25/arts/25KNOEDLER/25KNOEDLER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 299, 'width': 242, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/25/arts/25KNOEDLER/25KNOEDLER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/25/arts/25KNOEDLER/25KNOEDLER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/25/arts/25KNOEDLER/25KNOEDLER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'c