ry Clinton recently, will meet with Senator Bernie Sanders, whom he does not have much of a relationship with.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/01/26/bernie-sanders-and-president-obama-to-meet-in-oval-office-wednesday/', 'snippet': 'The president, who has spoken highly of Hillary Clinton recently, will meet with Senator Bernie Sanders, whom he does not have much of a relationship with.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama will meet in the Oval Office on Wednesday with Senator Bernie Sanders of Vermont, offering presidential face-time just days before voting in the presidential campaign begins next week, White House officials said Tuesday evening.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-sanders-1/28firstdraft-sanders-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-sanders-1/28firstdraft-sanders-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-sanders-1/28firstdraft-sanders-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-sanders-1/28firstdraft-sanders-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-sanders-1/28firstdraft-sanders-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-sanders-1/28firstdraft-sanders-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-sanders-1/28firstdraft-sanders-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bernie Sanders and President Obama to Meet in Oval Office Wednesday', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Invites Sanders to Oval Office For Meeting, With ‘No Formal Agenda’ ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Bernard', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-27T02:55:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear and Yamiche Alcindor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b4c0674-43d9-52a6-8c42-71f184dc57bd', 'word_count': 538, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b4c0674-43d9-52a6-8c42-71f184dc57bd'}, {'abstract': 'Jumping on the news that Donald Trump was sitting out Thursday night’s debate, Senator Ted Cruz playfully challenged Mr. Trump to a two-man showdown.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/01/26/who-needs-megyn-kelly-ted-cruz-says-hell-debate-donald-trump-one-on-one/', 'snippet': 'Jumping on the news that Donald Trump was sitting out Thursday night’s debate, Senator Ted Cruz playfully challenged Mr. Trump to a two-man showdown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FAIRFIELD, Iowa — Seeking to insert himself into the latest Donald J. Trump-created campaign controversy, Senator Ted Cruz on Tuesday night challenged Mr. Trump to a “mano a mano” debate, suggesting that if the Republican front-runner was too frightened to face Fox News’s Megyn Kelly, the two candidates could face off without a moderator.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-cruz-1/28firstdraft-cruz-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-cruz-1/28firstdraft-cruz-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-cruz-1/28firstdraft-cruz-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-cruz-1/28firstdraft-cruz-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-cruz-1/28firstdraft-cruz-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/28/us/politics/28firstdraft-cruz-1/28firstdraft-cruz-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight':