i': 'nyt://article/d17eaed6-713a-5b03-8901-d1afa78c2360'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. John is set to release his 33rd studio album, “Wonderful Crazy Night,” and says he still likes to rock out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/31/arts/music/elton-john-still-living-in-the-flourish.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. John is set to release his 33rd studio album, “Wonderful Crazy Night,” and says he still likes to rock out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — After 47 years in the spotlight, more than 250 million albums sold, six Grammys, a Tony, an Oscar and a knighthood, Elton John still gets the jitters when he steps onstage. Striding to his piano at the Wiltern here in a blue, rhinestone-dusted suit to play songs from his new album, “Wonderful Crazy Night,” for the first time, he surveyed the crowd of die-hard fans and music-industry insiders fretfully.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31SIR-ELTON/31SIR-ELTON-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 880, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31SIR-ELTON/31SIR-ELTON-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 880}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31SIR-ELTON/31SIR-ELTON-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 699, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31SIR-ELTON/31SIR-ELTON-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1397, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31SIR-ELTON/31SIR-ELTON-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, '