anson’s Lost Girls” focuses on the women he gathered into his circle nearly 50 years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s been almost 47 years since the murders orchestrated by Charles Manson in California. For younger generations to know about those crimes and understand the shock of them requires some passing-down of the story. A made-for-TV movie on Saturday, Feb. 6, on Lifetime tries to do this, and its cast embodies a passing-down tradition of its own: It includes several young actors following in a parent’s footsteps.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31GUIDE7/31GUIDE7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31GUIDE7/31GUIDE7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31GUIDE7/31GUIDE7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31GUIDE7/31GUIDE7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31GUIDE7/31GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31GUIDE7/31GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/arts/31GUIDE7/31GUIDE7-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150