tml', 'snippet': 'A book signing at the Shop at the Standard, new labels at Bergdorf Goodman and a new footwear line at Rag & Bone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The weather outside is frightful, but merchants are making shopping this week so delightful. Shake off the cold at Artists & Fleas, which is ringing in the last days of its “Not So Secret Sale” with a Last Chance Sip and Shop event Thursday from 6 to 9 p.m. Scoring deep discounts of up to 70 percent on items like sea glass necklaces ($22, originally $38) and photo prints of vintage toys ($13, originally $26) from a variety of clothing, accessories, art and home-goods vendors will be even nicer with a glass of bubbly or a Sixpoint beer in hand. At Chelsea Market, 88 10th Avenue.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/fashion/28Scout1/28Scout1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/28/fashion/28Scout1/28Scout1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/fashion/28Scout1/28Scout1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/fashion/28Scout1/28Scout1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1372, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/fashion/28Scout1/28Scout1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/28/fashion/28Scout1/28Scout1-thumbStandard.jp