ws him to make $27.5 million if he opts out after 2016, is the latest instance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/28/sports/baseball/yoenis-cespedes-mets-opt-out-deal.html', 'snippet': 'This has been the winter of the opt-out clause. The Mets’ three-year, $75 million deal with Yoenis Cespedes, which allows him to make $27.5 million if he opts out after 2016, is the latest instance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dave Dombrowski had never given an opt-out clause. He had never seen a benefit for his team and had never faced the choice that confronted him this winter, his first as president of baseball operations for the Boston Red Sox. Dombrowski could give an opt-out to the free agent David Price or miss out on the ace his team needed.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/sports/28OPTOUT-SILO/28OPTOUT-SILO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/28/sports/28OPTOUT-SILO/28OPTOUT-SILO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/sports/28OPTOUT-SILO/28OPTOUT-SILO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/sports/28OPTOUT-SILO/28OPTOUT-SILO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1478, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/sports/28OPTOUT-SILO/28OPTOUT-SILO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'im