n they immigrated from the Philippines — and along the way, we stopped at every single Cracker Barrel we saw. I can’t remember exactly why we did this, but its effects on my psyche have proved long-lasting. Even now, a Cracker Barrel works on me like Vegas on gambling addicts or Disney World on children: I know the optimism is fleeting and the fantasy is imagined, but I never manage to keep my cool.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/magazine/31lor/31mag-31lor-t_CA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 436, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/31/magazine/31lor/31mag-31lor-t_CA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 436}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/magazine/31lor/31mag-31lor-t_CA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 744, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/magazine/31lor/31mag-31lor-t_CA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1488, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/magazine/31lor/31lor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/31/magazine/31lor/31lor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/magazine/31lor/31lor-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Letter of Recommendation:\xa0Cracker Barrel', 'kicker': 'Letter of Recommendation', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cracker Barrel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tolentino, Jia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cracker Barrel Old Country Store', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Southern States (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-28T12:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jia Tolentino', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tolentino', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d691b42-fa33-53e0-a04b-23cbf992fe68', 'word_count': 955, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d691b42-fa33-53e0-a04b-23cbf992fe68'}, {'abstract': 'Based on a real-life 1952 rescue of men aboard a tanker in a brutal storm, this nostalgic film also features Casey Affleck as a heroic shipboard engineer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/29/movies/chris-pine-the-finest-hours-review.html', 'snippet': 'Based on a real-life 1952 rescue of men aboard a tanker in a brutal storm, this nostalgic film also features Casey Affleck as a heroic shipboard engineer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The waterlogged disaster movie “The Finest Hours” is a moderately gripping whoosh of nostalgia that shamelessly recycles the ’50s cliché of the squeaky-clean all-American hero. In this Disney movie, adapted from a book by Michael J. Tougias and Casey Sherman and based on real events in February 1952, Bernie Webber (Chris Pine), a Coast Guard sailor based in Chatham, Mass., leads a next-to-impossible rescue mission during the most fearsome nor’easter this side of “The Perfect Storm.”', 'pri