acter, voiced by Jack Black, reunites with his long-lost father just as all of China is menaced by a fearsome beast.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/29/movies/bryan-cranston-jack-black-kung-fu-panda-3-review.html', 'snippet': 'The film’s central character, voiced by Jack Black, reunites with his long-lost father just as all of China is menaced by a fearsome beast.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Kung Fu Panda 2,” in 2011, ended with a surprise: The title panda, genial Po (Jack Black), wasn’t an orphan, after all. So we knew that when “Kung Fu Panda 3” inevitably came along, it would be about Po’s reunion with the father he hadn’t seen since he was a cub.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/arts/kung/kung-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/28/arts/kung/kung-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/arts/kung/kung-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/arts/kung/kung-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1194, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/arts/kung/kung-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/28/arts/kung/kung-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image'