times.com/2016/01/29/movies/grimur-hakonarson-narrates-a-scene-from-rams.html', 'snippet': 'The director discusses a scene from his Icelandic drama “Rams.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Icelandic drama “Rams” follow two sheep-farmer brothers who haven’t spoken for 40 years, yet live next door to one another. A tragedy that affects their animals further tests their relationship. This scene involves a particularly intense moment between the brothers. In an interview at The Times, the director Grimur Hakonarson talked about his own experiences on a farm and how to cast sheep. Here are excerpts from that conversation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Grimur Hakonarson Narrates a Scene From ‘Rams’', 'kicker': 'Anatomy of a Scene', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Rams (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hakonarson, Grimur (1977- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-28T19:30:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e52383df-9396-5e19-b0ee-19c4fe223f1d', 'word_count': 354, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e52383df-9396-5e19-b0ee-19c4fe223f1d'}, {'abstract': 'The house showed magical spring/summer 2016 looks, heavily infused with Greco-Roman influences — but no shoes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2016/01/28/t-magazine/valentino-paris-couture-spring-2016-runway.html', 'snippet': 'The house showed magical spring/summer 2016 looks, heavily infused with Greco-Roman influences — but no shoes.', 'lead_para