om/2016/01/31/nyregion/look-up-over-the-hospital-its-super-proxy.html', 'snippet': 'In a health crisis, we all want superheroes, especially when a not-quite hospital takes its own sweet time treating a friend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We all entertain fantasies of being someone else, and mine lately is Super Proxy — a combination of Superwoman and a legally designated health care proxy, who can make medical decisions faster than a speeding bullet and leap over paperwork in a single bound. I’d especially enjoy using my superhuman strength to dangle the hospital admissions person out a window.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/nyregion/31MISINFORMED-copybw/31MISINFORMED-copybw-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/31/nyregion/31MISINFORMED-copybw/31MISINFORMED-copybw-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 764}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/nyregion/31MISINFORMED-copybw/31MISINFORMED-copybw-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 805, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/nyregion/31MISINFORMED-copybw/31MISINFORMED-copybw-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1609, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/nyregion/31MISINFORMED-copybw/31MISINFORMED-copybw-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/31/nyregion/31MISINFORMED-copybw/31MISINFORMED-copybw-thumb