g.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/29/a-day-at-the-bookstore-for-all-kids/', 'snippet': 'Taking a preschool class on a field trip into the mostly unknown: a bookstore.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The trouble with an event called “Take Your Child to a Bookstore Day” is obvious: The parents most likely to embrace it are the ones most likely to be bookstore regulars already, with children deeply familiar with the local store’s shelves and other amenities, from the worn pillows and the Thomas the Tank Engine table to the cup of crayons on the child-size table. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/bookstore-motherlode/bookstore-motherlode-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/28/us/bookstore-motherlode/bookstore-motherlode-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/bookstore-motherlode/bookstore-motherlode-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/bookstore-motherlode/bookstore-motherlode-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/28/us/bookstore-motherlode/bookstore-motherlode-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/28/us/bookstore-motherlode/bookstore-motherlode-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cre