ith Fox News, telling a packed hotel ballroom in New Hampshire that he had shown the world just how tough he could be when challenged.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/01/29/donald-trump-declares-victory-over-fox-news-then-takes-on-newspaper/', 'snippet': 'Donald J. Trump declared victory in his standoff with Fox News, telling a packed hotel ballroom in New Hampshire that he had shown the world just how tough he could be when challenged.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NASHUA, N.H. – Donald J. Trump declared victory in his standoff with Fox News on Friday, telling a packed hotel ballroom in New Hampshire that he had shown the world just how tough he could be when challenged.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Donald Trump Declares Victory Over Fox News, Then Takes On Newspaper', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Political)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Ted', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McQuaid, Joseph W', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox News Channel', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Hampshire Union Leader', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Hampshire', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-29T17:26:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexander Burns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexander', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c1118228-ca1b-5c1e-9b53-687f2e8749d5', 'word_count': 595, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c1118228-ca1b-5c1e-9b53-687f2e8749d5'}, {'abstract': 'Lara Casalotti’s search for a stem cell donor that matches her Italian, Thai and Chinese ancestry has gone viral, attracting international attention and scores of new potential donors.', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/01/29/match4lara-mixed-race-marrow-search-thats-going-viral/', 'snippet': 'Lara Casalotti’s search for a stem cell donor that matches her Italian, Thai and Chinese ancestry has gone viral, attracting international attention and scores of new potential donors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lara Casalotti, a 24-year-old global migration master’s student in Britain, had a pain in her lower back. At first it didn’t seem like much, but then when she was in Thailand researching migrant worker conditions, it grew worse and required hospitalization. On Dec. 14, the young human rights activist learned her pain wasn’t from a pulled muscle: She was diagnosed with acute myeloid leukemia, a blood cancer that would require a stem cell transplant by April to save her life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/29/opinion/29kristof_blog/29kristof_blog-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/29/opinion/29kristof_blog/29kristof_blog-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/29/opinion/29kristof_blog/29kristof_blog-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'lega