ral artists participating in Paramount Ranch took inspiration from the event’s setting: the eponymous film set, of “Gunsmoke” fame.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/29/t-magazine/art/paramount-ranch-art-fair-los-angeles.html', 'snippet': 'Several artists participating in Paramount Ranch took inspiration from the event’s setting: the eponymous film set, of “Gunsmoke” fame.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Art fairs, typically housed in convention centers and white tents, are rarely wild and woolly affairs. But as the art industry flies southwest this winter for its fair season — anchored in Art Los Angeles Contemporary, held at the Barker Hanger, and Photo LA, at the LA Mart downtown — they will find an exception to this rule at Paramount Ranch. Situated in the Santa Monica Mountains just north of Malibu, the three-year-old event takes place on the eponymous Western film set that served as the backdrop for such horse operas as “Gunfight at the OK Corral” and “Gunsmoke.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-paramount/29tmag-paramount-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-paramount/29tmag-paramount-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-paramount/29tmag-paramount-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-paramount/29tmag-paramount-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capti