2f70-ca30-5feb-8155-a86dc51fcc3e'}, {'abstract': 'Netflix is producing a limited-series revival of the fan favorite to be overseen by the series creator, Amy Sherman-Palladino.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/29/arts/television/gilmore-girls-set-to-return-on-netflix.html', 'snippet': 'Netflix is producing a limited-series revival of the fan favorite to be overseen by the series creator, Amy Sherman-Palladino.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Friday afternoon is usually a time to release unwelcome news but this annoucement from Netflix will be anything but for “Gilmore Girls” fans: A new limited-series reunion of the show is officially in the works. It will feature the stars Lauren Graham and Alexis Bledel and be overseen by the series creator, Amy Sherman-Palladino.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/21/arts/gilmore-sub/gilmore-sub-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/10/21/arts/gilmore-sub/gilmore-sub-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/21/arts/gilmore-sub/gilmore-sub-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 673, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/21/arts/gilmore-sub/gilmore-sub-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1346, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/10/21/arts/gilmore-sub/gilmore-sub-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/10/21/arts/gilmore