sed to call a “film maudit,” or cursed film. The production, started in early 2013, was thrown into disarray when its original director, the visionary Lynne Ramsay, left mere days into shooting. At least two key cast and crew members followed her. In addition, the movie’s original distributor, Relativity Media, lost the rights to the picture in a bankruptcy proceeding. The final film was released by the Weinstein Company, without screenings for reviewers.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/30/arts/30JANE/30JANE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/30/arts/30JANE/30JANE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/30/arts/30JANE/30JANE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/30/arts/30JANE/30JANE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/30/arts/30JANE/30JANE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/30/arts/30JANE/30JANE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/30/arts/30JANE/30JANE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘Jane Got a Gun,’ Clear Skies, Followed by a Hail of Bullets', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clear Skies, Followed by a Hail of Bullets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Connor, Gavin", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Portman, Natalie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Edgerton, Joel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ramsay, Lynne', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Jane Got a Gun (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-29T23:16:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Glenn Kenny', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Glenn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kenny', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/db0f71d8-9dcf-50bc-a6c2-bbd86f40e9b9', 'word_count': 323, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db0f71d8-9dcf-50bc-a6c2-bbd86f40e9b9'}, {'abstract': 'The sovereign wealth fund, called 1Malaysia Development Berhad, or 1MDB, has been the focus of investigations around the world involving misappropriated money.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/30/world/asia/swiss-question-use-of-malaysian-sovereign-fund-run-by-prime-minister.html', 'snippet': 'The sovereign wealth fund, called 1Malaysia Development Berhad, or 1MDB, has been the focus of investigations around the world involving misappropriated money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Days after the prime minister of Malaysia was cleared of wrongdoing in an investigation into transfers of money into his bank accounts, the Swiss government announced Friday that it had found serious indications that funds had been misappropriated from Malaysian state-owned companies.', 'print_section