dle-of-the road voters in New Hampshire while his opponents scoured Iowa for last-minute converts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/01/30/john-kasich-courts-new-hampshire-independents/', 'snippet': '“The Republican Party is my vehicle, but it has never been my master,” Mr. Kasich said as he wooed middle-of-the road voters in New Hampshire while his opponents scoured Iowa for last-minute converts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KEENE, N.H. – Of all the Republicans campaigning in New Hampshire, Gov. John Kasich of Ohio has appealed most explicitly to the state’s population of unpredictable independent voters and moderate Republicans, who play an outsize role in presidential primaries here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/30/us/kasich-firstdraft/kasich-firstdraft-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/30/us/kasich-firstdraft/kasich-firstdraft-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/30/us/kasich-firstdraft/kasich-firstdraft-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/30/us/kasich-firstdraft/kasich-firstdraft-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/30/us/kasich-firstdraft/kasich-firstdraft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/30/us/kasich-firstdraft/kasich-firstdraft