: 'Yoshitha Rajapaksa, the second son of former President Mahinda Rajapaksa, was arrested by financial crimes investigators after being questioned over his involvement in alleged money-laundering.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/01/31/world/asia/authorities-arrest-son-of-ex-leader-in-sri-lanka.html', 'snippet': 'Yoshitha Rajapaksa, the second son of former President Mahinda Rajapaksa, was arrested by financial crimes investigators after being questioned over his involvement in alleged money-laundering.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COLOMBO, Sri Lanka — Sri Lankan authorities arrested a son of former President Mahinda Rajapaksa on money-laundering charges on Saturday, the government’s latest attempt to prosecute members of the previous administration, many of whom have been under investigation since Mr. Rajapaksa’s election defeat last year.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/world/SRI-LANKA/SRI-LANKA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 874, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/31/world/SRI-LANKA/SRI-LANKA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 874}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/world/SRI-LANKA/SRI-LANKA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 704, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/world/SRI-LANKA/SRI-LANKA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1427, 'width': 980, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/world/SRI-LANKA/SRI-LANKA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail',