om-the-final-dash-of-presidential-candidates-in-iowa.html', 'snippet': 'Candidates are crisscrossing the state this weekend in a frantic sprint, cajoling the last undecided voters and energizing supporters before Monday’s caucuses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After hundreds of campaign stops and tens of thousands of television ads, candidates are crisscrossing Iowa this weekend on a final, frantic dash, cajoling the last undecided voters and energizing supporters to head to Monday night’s caucuses. Fending off drowsiness with Red Bull and Katy Perry songs, they are racing through a mind-muddying 55 events, from Dubuque in the northeast to Council Bluffs in the southwest, in a blur of speeches and handshakes.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/us/31dispatches-web2/31dispatches-web2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/31/us/31dispatches-web2/31dispatches-web2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/us/31dispatches-web2/31dispatches-web2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/us/31dispatches-web2/31dispatches-web2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/us/31dispatches-web2/31dispatches-web2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/01/31/us/31dispatches-web2/31dispatches-web2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/31/us/31dispatches-web2/31dispatches-web2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dispatches From the Final Dash of Presidential Candidates in Iowa', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dispatches From the Final Dash Across Iowa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haberman, Maggie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alcindor, Yamiche', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Ted', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Bernard', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, Jeb', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-31T02:24:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/134aa73d-c027-5014-85c4-973732729a7e', 'word_count': 2191, 'uri': 'nyt://article/134aa73d-c027-5014-85c4-973732729a7e'}, {'abstract': 'President Xi’s arrival after the lifting of sanctions related to Iran’s nuclear program provided a moment for China to set the stage for future deal-making.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.c