ions', 'value': 'Treasury Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-31T22:26:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/af3e0481-8ff7-59f8-be9a-b8445571c3dd', 'word_count': 372, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af3e0481-8ff7-59f8-be9a-b8445571c3dd'}, {'abstract': 'The Spanish early-music specialist Mr. Savall and the student orchestra performed at the Metropolitan Museum of Art.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/02/01/arts/music/review-jordi-savall-and-juilliard415-perform-in-shakespeare-and-cervantes.html', 'snippet': 'The Spanish early-music specialist Mr. Savall and the student orchestra performed at the Metropolitan Museum of Art.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cervantes and Shakespeare died 400 years ago, though not on the same day, as many continue to maintain. For Cervantes, the date on his tombstone — April 23, 1616 — may refer to his burial, and for Shakespeare, the same date was based on the Julian calendar; by the modern Gregorian calendar, it is May 3.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/02/01/arts/01SAVALL-SUB/01SAVALL-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/02/01/arts/01SAVALL-SUB/01SAVALL-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/02/01/arts/01SAVALL-SUB/01SAVALL-SUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/02/01/arts/01SAVALL-SUB/01SAVALL-SUB-super