2016/02/01/nyregion/man-slashed-in-face-after-argument-on-harlem-subway-platform.html', 'snippet': 'The 27-year-old man was attacked at 110th Street and Lenox Avenue, in an episode that joined a spate of slashings that have put New York City on edge over the past month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A man was slashed in the face as he stood on the subway platform at 110th Street and Lenox Avenue in Harlem early on Sunday, after getting into an argument with a woman he did not know, the police said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Man Slashed in Face After Argument on Harlem Subway Platform', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man, 27, Is Slashed in Face After Fight at Subway Stop', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nir, Sarah Maslin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Harlem (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subways', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bratton, William J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-01-31T23:01:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Maslin Nir and Benjamin Mueller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': 'Maslin', 'lastname': 'Nir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mueller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2381bbfd-2ce1-58fd-99c3-ad77c87d3100', 'word_count': 363, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2381bbfd-2ce1-58fd-99c3-ad77c87d3100'}, {'abstract': 